<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Mathaia</book>
  <para style="h">Mathaia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mathaia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mathaia</para>
  <para style="mt">Mathaia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua Krista chu Davida thlah a ni a, Abrahama aṭanga an inthlah chhâwn dân chu hetiang hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abrahaman fapa Isaka a nei a, Isakan Jakoba. Jakoban Juda leh a unaute.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judan Tamari lakah Faresa leh Zera, Faresan Esroma, Esroman Arama.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Araman Aminadaba. Aminadaban Nasona, Nasonan Salmona.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Salmonan Rahabi lakah Boaza, Boazan Ruthi lakah Obeda, Obedan Jesaia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesaian fapa, lal Davida a nei a. Davidan Uria nupui lakah fapa Solomona a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomonan Rehoboama, Rehoboaman Abia, Abian Asafa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />AsafanR Jehosafata, Jehosafatan Jehorama, Jehoraman Uzia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uzian Jothama, Jothaman Ahaza. Ahazan Hezekia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekian Manasea, Manasean Amosa, Amosan Josia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Babulon sala hruai lai vêl khân Josian Jekonia leh a unaute a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babulon-a sala an hruai hnuin Jekonian fapa Sealtiela a nei a. Sealtielan Zerubabela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zerubabelan Abiuda, Abiudan Eliakima, Eliakiman Azora.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azoran Zadoka, Zadokan Akima, Akiman Eliuda.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eliudan Eleazara, Eleazaran Mathana. Mathanan Jakoba.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakoban Josefa, Mari pasal chu a nei a; Mari lakah Isua, Krista an tih chu, a lo piang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Abrahama leh Davida inkârah chhuan sâwm leh chhuan li an awm a, Davida leh Babulon sala hruai inkârah pawh chhuan sâwm leh chhuan li an awm a, Babulon sala hruai leh Krista inkârah chhuan sâwm leh chhuan li bawk an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Isua Krista lo pian dân chu hetiang hi a ni: A nu Mari chu Josefa nupui hual a ni a, an inpâwl hmain Thlarau Thianghlimin nau a paitîr tih hriat a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pasal tûr Josefa chu mi fel tak a ni a, tihmualpho a duh lo va, a rûka ṭhen a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng thu chu a ngaihtuah lai chuan, ngai teh, a mangah Lalpa tirh vântirhkoh a hmu a. “Josef, Davida fapa, i nupui hual Mari hi neih tîm suh, a nau pai chu Thlarau Thianghlim laka mi a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Fapa a hring ang a, a hmingah ISUA sa ang che; ani chuan a mite chu an sualte lak ata a chhandam dâwn si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpan zâwlnei hmanga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ngai teh, nula thianghlim chuan nau a pai ang a, Fapa a hring ang a, A hmingah Imanuela an sa ang,” (chu chu ‘Kan hnêna Pathian awm’ tihna a ni) tia a sawi kha a lo thlen theih nân hêng zawng zawng hi a lo awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Josefa muhîl chu a lo harh a, Lalpa Vântirhkoh thupêk ang chuan a ti a. Mari chu nupuiah a nei ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nimahsela, fapa a hrin hma chu a pâwl lo, nau hmingah chuan Isua a sa ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Heroda a lal laia, Judai rama Bethlehem khuaa Isua a lo pianin, ngai teh, khawchhak lam aṭangin mi fingte Jerusalem-ah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Khawiah nge Juda-te lal tûr nau lo piang chu? Khawchhak lamah a arsi kan hmu a, amah chibai bûk tûrin kan lo kal a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu chu lal Herodan a hriatin a buai ta hle a, Jerusalem-a mi zawng zawng pawh an buai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, puithiam lalte leh vântlâng Dân zirtîrtu zawng zawng chu a ko khâwm a, Krista pianna tûr hmun a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Judai ram Bethlehem khuaa piang tûr a ni. Hetiangin zâwlneiin a ziak kha:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Nang, Bethlehem, Judai rama mi, Judai ram khawpui zîngah i tê ber tawp lo, I chhûng aṭangin awptu a lo chhuak dâwn si a, Ka mi Israel-te vêngtu tûr chu,’ ” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Herodan mi fingte chu a rûkin a ko va, arsi lan hun lai chu ngun takin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bethlehem-ah chuan a kaltîr a, “Kal ta ula, naute thu chu ngun takin zâwt chhuak ula; kei pawhin ani chu chibai ka rawn bûk ve theih nân in hmuh hunah mi rawn hrilh leh ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal thu chu an hria a, an kal ta a; khawchhak lama arsi an hmuh khân naute awmna chung zâwn a thlena a din hma chu an hma a hruai zêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arsi chu an hmuhin an hlim êm êm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />in chhûnga an va luh chuan a nu Mari bula nautê chu an hmu a, lei sia kûnin chibai an bûk a; an robâwmte an hawng a, thilpêk - rangkachak te, beraw te, mura te an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Heroda hnêna kîr leh lo tûra an manga hrilh an nih avângin an ram panin kawng dangah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An hâwn hnuin, ngai teh, Lalpa Vântirhkoh Josefan a mangah a hmu a, “Tho la, nautê leh a nu hruai la, Aigupta ramah kal bo rawh; ka hrilh leh hma che zawng chutah chuan awm reng ang che, tihboral tumin Herodan nautê hi a zawng dâwn a ni,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, a tho va, nautê leh a nu chu a hruai a, a zân a zânin Aigupta ramah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Heroda thih hma chu chutah chuan an awm ta a. Lalpan zâwlnei hmanga, “Ka fapa chu Aigupta ram ata ka ko chhuak a,” tia a sawi kha a lo thlen theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, mi fingten an tihder a ni tih Herodan a hriatin a thin a ur ta êm êm a, a hun thu a zawha an hrilh ang khân Bethlehem leh a vêl zawng zawnga mipa naupang kum hnih chin hnuai lam chu a va thahtîr ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zâwlnei Jeremian:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Rama khuaah thâwm an hria, Lusûn leh ṭap chuah chuah thâwm chu; Rakili chuan a fate a ṭah a, An awm tawh loh avângin a hnem theih loh,” tia a sawi kha a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Heroda chu a thih hnuin, Aigupta ramah chuan Josefan a mangah Lalpa vântirhkoh a hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tho la, nautê leh a nu hruai la, Israel ramah haw tawh rawh; nautê thah tumtute kha an thi tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, a tho va, nautê leh a nu chu a hruai a, Israel ram chu an pan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Arkelausa chu a pa Heroda aiawhin Judai ramah a lal tih a hriatin chuta kal chu a hlau va, a mumanga hriattîrna a dawn angin Galili ram lamah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khaw pakhat, Nazaret an tihah chuan a va awm a, “Ani chu, ‘Nazaret mi,’ an ti ang,” tia zâwlneite sawi kha a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan baptistu Johana chu Judai ram thlalêrah thu hrilin a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sim rawh u, vânram chu a hnai tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani hi a ni, zâwlnei Isaian, “Thlalêra mi au aw chuan, ‘Lalpa lamlian chei ṭha ula, A kal nân kawng tluang siam rawh u,’ a ti,” tia a sawi kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu Johana chuan sanghâwngsei hmul kawr a ha a, savun kâwnghrên a hrêng a, a chaw chu khaukhuap leh ram khawizu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Jerusalem leh Judai ram hmun tina awmte leh Jordan luidung vêl ram zawng zawnga awmte chuan ani chu an pan huai huai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />an sualte an puang a, Jordan luiah chuan a lo baptis hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Farisai leh Sadukai tam tak baptisma chang tûra lo kal ve a hmuhin an hnênah, “Rûl thlahte u, thinur lo thleng tûr pumpelh nân tu nge baptisma chang tûra fuih che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In sim ngei a ni tih tilang tûrin thil ti zêl zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Kan pa chu Abrahama asin’ in lo ti dah ang e; ka hrilh a che u, Pathian chuan hêng lung hi Abrahama thlahah a din thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tûn apangin thing bul tinah hreipui an dah ta, thing eng pawh rah ṭhaa rah lo chu kiha meia tuah mai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei zawngin sim entîr nân tuiin ka baptis ṭhîn che u a; ka hnunga lo kal tûr erawh chu kei aiin a ropui zâwk a, a pheikhawk keng tlâk pawh ka ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani zawngin Thlarau Thianghlim leh meiin a baptis ang che u; a hruiha buh chu zâp faia zêma khung mai tûrin a sisêp chu a keng tawh a, a site erawh chu tihmih rual loh meiah a hâl ral ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Galili ram aṭangin Johana hnênah, Jordan luia baptisma chang tûrin Isua chu a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Johana erawh chuan, “Mi baptis tûr i ni zâwk si a, ka hnênah i lo kal a ni maw?” tiin a hnial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan, “Tûnah remti hrâm rawh, hetiang felna zawng zawng hlen chhuah hi kan tân a mawi a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, a remti ta a. Isuan baptisma a chan zawh chuan tui ata chu a chhuak nghâl a; a tân vân a lo inhawng a, Pathian Thlarau chu ṭhuro anga lo chhukin a chunga fu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai teh, vân aṭanga awin, “Hei hi ka Fapa, ka Duhtaka chu a ni, a chungah ka lâwm êm êm a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi zawh chuan Isua chu Diabola thlêm tûrin thlalêrah Thlarauvin a hruai chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni sawmli leh zân sawmli chaw a nghei hnuin a ril a lo ṭâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thlêmtu chu a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Pathian Fapa i nih tak tak chuan hêng lung hi chhanga chang tûrin thu pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Mihring hi chhang ringawt ringin an nung tûr a ni lo. Pathian ka aṭanga thuchhuak tinrêng an ring bawk tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Diabola chuan ani chu khaw thianghlimah a hruai lût a. Tempul chhîpah a dintîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a hnênah, “Pathian Fapa i nih meuh chuan zuang thla rawh. ‘I chungthu-ah zawng vântirhkohte thu a pe ang a, An kutin an dâwm ang chia, Tichuan, lungah i ke i sawh dâwn lo nia,’ tih ziak a ni si,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isua chuan a hnênah, “‘Lalpa i Pathian fiah suh’ tih ziak a ni bawk asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Diabola chuan tlang sâng takah a hruai leh a, khawvêl ram zawng zawng leh a ropuina a entîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a hnênah, “Lei siin chibai mi bûk la, hêng zawng zawng hi ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Setan, kal bo daih rawh, ‘Lalpa i Pathian chu chibai bûk la, ama rawng chauh bâwl rawh,’ tih ziak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Diabola chuan a kalsan a, vântirhkohten rawng an bâwlsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Johana an man tih a hriatin Isua chu Galili ramah a kal ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nazaret chhuahsanin Kapernaum khuaah a zu awm ta reng a, chu chu Zebulun leh Naftali biala dîl kama awm a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />zâwlnei Isaia sawi kha a lo thleng ta a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Zebulun leh Naftali ram Tuipui panna kawng, Jordan râl, Jentail-te chênna Galili.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thim hnuaia ṭhute chuan êng nasa tak an hmu a, Thihna ram thima chêngte chungah chuan êng a lo chhuak ta,” a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuta chinah chuan Isuan, “Sim rawh u, vânram chu a hnai tawh e,” tiin a hril ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Galili dîl kama a lên pahin unau pahnih, Simona, Petera an tih leh Andria chu dîla an lên dêng a va hmu a; sangha man mi an ni rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An hnênah, “Mi zui rawh u; tichuan, mihring mantuah ka siam ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An lênte chu an hnutchhiah a, ani chu an zui ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan a kal zêl a, unau dang pahnih, Zebedaia fa, Jakoba leh Johana chu a hmu a, an pa Zebedaia hovin lawngah an lên an lo ṭhui ṭha a, anni chu a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, lawng leh an pa chu an kalsan a, Isua chu an zui ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isua chuan Galili ram a fang vêl a, an sunagog -ahte zirtîrin, Ram Chanchin ṭha chu a hril a, Israel-te zînga natna tinrêng leh chak lohna tinrênga nâte chu a tidam zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Suria ram zawng zawngah a chanchin chu a thang ta a; damlo zawng zawng, damlohna leh natna tinrêng tuar te, ramhuai man te, thla-em-ât te leh zeng te, a hnênah an rawn hruai a, a lo tidam hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galili ram aṭang te, Dekapoli khua aṭang te, Jerusalem aṭang te, Judai ram aṭang te leh Jordan râl aṭang te chuan mipui nasa takin amah an zui a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipui chu a hmuhin tlângah a chho va, a ṭhu a, a zirtîrte an lo kal khâwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />thu a sawi a, anmahni a lo zirtîr a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thlarau lama an pachhiatzia inhriate chu an chan a ṭha e, vânram chu an ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Lungngaite chu an chan a ṭha e, thlamuan an la ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Thuhnuairawlhte chu an chan a ṭha e, ram chu an la rochung dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Felna duha rilṭâma tuihâlte chu an chan a ṭha e, an la tlai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Khawngaihna nei mite chu an chan a ṭha e, khawngaih an la hlawh dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Thinlunga thianghlimte chu an chan a ṭha e, Pathian an la hmu dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Remna siamtute chu an chan a ṭha e, Pathian fate tih an la ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Felna avânga tihduhdah tuartute chu an chan a ṭha e, vânram chu an ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Keimah avânga miin an hau che ua, an tihduhdah che u a, dik lo taka sual tinrêng tia an puh hun che u chuan in chan a va ṭha dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lâwm ula, hlim takin awm rawh u, vânah in lâwmman a awm hnem si a; chutiang bawkin in hmaa zâwlneite pawh kha an tiduhdah ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Lei chi in ni e; nimahsela, chi hi da ta ang se, engtia tihal leh tûr nge ni ang? Paih chhuaha, mite rah mai mai chauhvah lo chuan eng atân mah a tlâktlai tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Khawvêl êng in ni e. Tlângchhîpa khaw awm chu thuhrûk theih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miin an khâwnvâr chhit chu khovin an khuh ngai lo, a dahnaah an dah zâwk ṭhîn; tichuan, in chhûnga mi zawng zawng a ên ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin in êng chu mi hmuhin êng rawh se; chutichuan, in thil ṭha tihte an hmu ang a, in Pa vâna mi an chawimawi thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Dân thu emaw, zâwlneite thu emaw ṭhiat tûra lo kal ka nih ring suh u, ṭhiat tûr ni lovin tifamkim tûra lo kal ka ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, lei leh vân hi a awm chhûng chu Dân thu-a mi chhun han hlek emaw, thai han hlek emaw, a zaa a thlen kim zet hma chuan a pakhat mah hi a râl tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, hêng thupêk zînga pawimawh lo ber pakhat pawh hi ngainêpa, chutianga ti ve tûra mite zirtîr apiang chu vânramah chuan mi tê ber an ti ang; amaherawhchu, tu pawh zâwma, zirtîr ve chu vânramah chuan mi lian an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In felnain Dân zirtîrtute leh Farisai-te felna a khûm loh chuan vânramah in lût tawp lo vang tih ka hrilh che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hmânlai mite hnênah, ‘Tual i that tûr a ni lo, tual that rêng rêng chu an chungthu rêl tûr a ni,’ tih a nih thu in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ka hrilh a che u, mahni unau chunga thinur chu a chungthu rêl tûr a ni; a unau ‘mi chhawihpa,’ ti chu Sanhedrin-a rêl tûr a ni ang; a unau ‘mi â pa,’ ti phei chu hremhmun meia kal tlâk a ni tih ka hrilh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, i thilpêk maichâma i hlan dâwn laiin i unauvin i chungah lungnih lohna a nei tih i hriat chhuah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />maichâm hmaah i thilpêk chu hnutchhiah la, kal langin, i unau chu rem zet la, chumi hnuah i thilpêk chu hlân rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I khingpui chu kalkawnga in kal dun laiin rem thuai rawh; chutilo chu, rorêltu a mantîr ang chia, rorêltu chuan pulis hnênah a hlân ang chia, tân inah an khung hlauh dah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che, pawisa pakhat pawh i tlâk kim hma chu chuta ta chu i chhuak tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“ ‘I uire tûr a ni lo,’ tih a nih in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh, ngaih châka hmeichhe melhtu chu, a thinlungah a uire tawh reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />I mit ding lamin a tihtlûk che chuan kher chhuak la, paih daih rawh; i taksa a puma hremhmuna paih a nih ai chuan, i taksa pêng pakhat boral chu i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, i kut ding lamin a tihtlûk che chuan, tan la, paih daih rawh; i taksa a puma hremhmuna paih a nih ai chuan, i taksa pêng pakhat boral chu i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“ ‘Tu pawh nupui ma chuan mâkna lehkha pe rawh se,’ tih a ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ka hrilh a che u, uire vâng ni lova nupui ma apiang chuan an nupui chu an uiretîr a ni, mâk hnu nei pawh an uire a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Hmânlai mite hnênah, ‘dâwtin chhia chham suh la, Lalpa hnênah i chhechham chu i hlen tûr a ni,’ tih a nih in hre bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ka hrilh a che u, chhia rêng rêng chham suh u; vân chhâlin chham suh u, chu chu Pathian lalṭhutthlêng a ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />lei chhâlin chham bawk hek suh u, chu chu a ke nghahchhan a ni si a; Jerusalem chhâl pawhin chham suh u, chu chu Lal ropui tak khawpui a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />I lu chhâlin i chham tûr a ni hek lo, samzai pakhat pawh i tivârin i tidum thei si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />In thu sawi chu ‘ni,’ emaw, ‘ni lo,’ emaw ni ngawt rawh se, chûng aliam chu sual laka chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“ ‘Mit aiah mit, ha aiah ha,’ tih a nih in hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ka hrilh a che u; mi sual dodâl suh u; i biang ding lam bêngtu hnênah chuan a lehlam pawh dawh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tu pawhin i lakah thu pawi siamin i kawr lâk an tum chuan, I puan pawh lâktîr mai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, km. khat hruai luitu che chu km. hnih zui rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An dîl che chuan pe la, i laka pûk duhtu chu hawisan suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“ ‘I vêngte i hmangaih tûr a ni a, i hmêlma chu i haw tûr a ni,’ tih a nih in hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ka hrilh a che u: i hmêlmate chu hmangaih la, a tiduhdahtu che chu ṭawngṭaisak rawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />in Pa vâna mi fate in nih theih nân ani chuan mi sualte leh mi ṭhate chungah ni a chhuahtîr a, mi dik leh dik lote chungah pawh ruah a surtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nangmahni hmangaihtute chauh in hmangaih hian lâwmman eng nge in hmuh bîk ang? Chhiahkhawntute pawhin chutiangin an ti ve lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, in unaute chauh chibai in bûk hian eng nge in tih hnem chuan bîk? Jentail-te pawhin chutiangin an ti ve lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chutichuan, in Pa vâna mi a ṭha famkim angin in ṭha famkim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“In thil ṭha tihte mi hmuh atân, an hmaa ti lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh u; chutilo chu in Pa vâna mi hnêna lâwmman in hmu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, khawngaih thilpêk i hlanin, mi vervêkten mi fak an hlawh theih nân sunagog-ah te leh kawtthlêrah te an ti ṭhîn ang hian i hmaah tawtawrâwt hâm suh. Thu dik ka hrilh a che, an lâwmman chu an hmu tawh reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan khawngaih thilpêk i hlanin, i kut ding lam tih chu i kut vei lamin hre suh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />i thilpêk chu a rûka a awm theih nân; chutichuan, i Pa, a rûka hmu ṭhîntu chuan a rûl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“In ṭawngṭai pawhin mi vervêkte angin awm suh u; miin an hmuh theih nân sunagog-ah te, kawtthlêr ṭhuam laiah te ding chunga ṭawngṭai an ngaina si ṭhîn. Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, an lâwmman chu an hmu tawh reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang erawh chu i ṭawngṭai hunin, i pindan chhûng rilah lût la, kawng khâr la, i Pa, a rûka awm hnênah chuan ṭawngṭai rawh; tichuan, i Pa, a rûka hmu ṭhîntu chuan a rûl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“In ṭawngṭaiin Jentail-te angin sawi nawn mai mai suh u; an ṭawng tam avângin hriain an ring a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anmahni angin awm suh u, in dîl hma pawhin in Pa chuan in mamawhte chu a hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, nangni chu hetiang hian ṭawngṭai rawh u: ‘Kan Pa, vâna mi, I hming zahin awm rawh se. I ram lo thleng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I duhzâwng vâna tih a nih angin leiah tih ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawiinah hian kan ei khawp chaw min pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan laka bate kan ngaidam angin, kan batte hi min ngaihdamsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thlêmnaah min hruai lût suh la, Mi sual lakah chuan min chhandam zâwk ang che.’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An bawhchhiatnaah mite in ngaihdam chuan, in Pa vâna mi pawhin a ngaidam ve ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In ngaihdam loh erawh chuan in Pain in bawhchhiatnaahte a ngaidam bîk lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Chaw in nghei hun pawhin mi vervêkte angin ngui hmêl pu suh u; anni zawngin mi hmuha chaw ngheia an lan theih nân an hmêl an tipawr si ṭhîn a. Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, an lâwmman chu an hmu tawh reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan chaw i nghei hunin, sahriak thih la, i hmai phih rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I Pa, a rûka awm hnênah chauh lo chuan mi hmuhah chaw ngheiin i lang lo vang; tichuan, i Pa a rûka hmu ṭhîntu chuan a rûl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Leiah, thîm leh tuiêkin a ei chhiatnaah, rûkruten an reh pawha an rûknaah hian in tân ro khâwl khâwm suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vânah, thîm leh tuiêkin a ei chhiat lohnaah, rûkruten an reh pawha an rûk hek lohnaah chuan in tân ro khâwl khâwm zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In ro awmna apiangah in rilru pawh a awm ṭhin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mit hi taksa tân khâwnvâr ang a ni, I mit a dik chuan i taksa chu a pum ên ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />i mit a dik loh erawh chuan i pumin i thim vek ang. Tichuan, nangmaha êng awm chu a thim si chuan, chu thim chu a va nasa dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tu man hotu pahnih rawng an bâwl kawp thei lo, pakhat huain pakhat an duh emaw a ni ang a; a nih loh leh pakhat chu an ngaina ang a, pakhat chu an hmusit ang. Pathian rawng leh sum rawng in bâwl kawp thei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Chuvâng chuan, ka hrilh a che u, in nun nân eng nge in ei anga in in ang tih te, in taksa tân eng nge in sin ang tih te lungkham suh u. Ei tûr aiin nunna a pawimawh zâwk a, silhfên aiin taksa pawh a pawimawh zâwk lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chunglêng savate hi en ta che u, buh an tuh lo va, an seng lo va, buh inahte an khung khâwm hek lo; mahse, in Pa vâna mi chuan a châwm si a; anni ai chuan in hlu zâwk daih lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangniho zîngah lungkham avângin tu nge mahni nun tisei hret thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Silhfên thu engah nge in lungkham ni? Ram tûktinpâr ṭhan dânte hi ngaihtuah teh u, hna an thawk lo va, la an dek hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u, Solomona meuh pawh a ropui thei ang bera a inthuam khân hêng tûktinpâr pakhat tluk pawh hian chei a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Chutichuan, ram hnim, vawiina nung, a tûka meia tuah leh mai tûr mah Pathianin chuti kauva a chei si chuan, aw, nangni rin tlêmte u, chûngte ai chuan a thuam nasa zâwk dâwn lo che u em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvângin, eng nge in eia in in anga, eng nge in silha in fên ang tih lungkham suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jentail-ten chûng chu an buaipui ber a ni: hêng zawng zawng hi nangni pawhin in mamawh tih in Pain a hre reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A ram leh a felna chu zawng hmasa zâwk rawh u; tichuan, hêng zawng zawng hi a pêk belhchhah dâwn che u nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chuvângin, a tûk atân lungkham suh u, a tûk chuan ama tân a ngaihtuah chawp dâwn si a. Ni khat hrehawm hi ni khat atân a tâwk e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sawisêl suh u, sawisêla in awm loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In sawisêlna ang bawkin sawisêl in ni ang a, in tehna ngeiin an tehsak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Engtizia nge mahni mita thingtum awm chu hre si lovin in unau mita thil tê tak tê awm chu in hmuh ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nih leh, engtin nge mahni mita thingtum awm reng siin i unau hnênah, ‘I mita thil tê tak tê awm kha mi lâk chhuahtîr rawh,’ i tih theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh, nangma mit ngeiah thingtum a awm ruau si a. Mi vervêk, i mita thingtum awm kha la chhuak hmasa zet rawh; tichuan, i unau mita thil tê tak tê lâk chhuah tûr chu fiah takin i hmu thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Uite chu thil thianghlim pe suh ula, vawk hmaah pawh in tuikeplung vawrh hek suh u; an chîl hrep ang a, an rawn tai thlêr dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Dîl ula, pêk in ni ang; zawng ula, in hmu ang; kik ula, hawnsak in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A dîl apiangin an dawng ṭhîn a, a zawng apiangin an hmu bawk ṭhîn; tu pawh a kik chu an hawnsak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nih leh, nangniho zînga tu pawh hi, a fapain chhang dîl sela, tu nge lung pe ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sangha dîl ta sela tu nge rûl pe ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, nangni mi sual mahin in fate thil ṭha pêk nachâng in hriat chuan in Pa vâna mi chuan a dîltute chu thil ṭha a va pe dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Chutichuan, thil eng pawh miin in chunga an tih in duh tûr ang apiang chu, mi chungah pawh ti ve rawh u; chu chu Dân leh zâwlneite thu a ni rêng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kawngka zîmah chuan lût rawh u, boralna kawngka chu a zau va, a kawng pawh a nuam a, chumi lama kalte chu tam tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nunna kawngka erawh chu a zîm a, a kawng pawh a chêp a, a hmutute pawh tlêm tê an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Zâwlnei derte lakah fîmkhur rawh u, chûng chu berâm vun sinin in hnênah an lo kal ṭhîn; an chhûng lamah erawh chuan chinghne koham tak an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anni chu an rahah in hre mai ang. Hlîngbukah grep an lo ngai em ni? Lênhlîngah theipui an lo ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thing ṭha chu a rah ṭha ṭhîn a, thing chhia chu a rah chhe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thing ṭha a rah chhe thei lo va, thing chhia lah a rah ṭha thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thing tin rah ṭhaa rah lo apiang chu an kit a, meiah an tuah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu an rahah in hre mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“‘Lalpa, Lalpa,’ mi ti nazawng chu vânramah an lût lo vang a, ka Pa vâna mi duhzâwng titute erawh chu an lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan mi tam takin, ‘Lalpa, Lalpa, i hmingin thute kan hril a, i hmingin ramhuaite kan hnawt chhuak a, i hmingin thil makte kan ti ṭhîn lo vem ni?’ an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan, ‘Nangni thil sual titute u, ka hre ngai lo va che u, ka hnên ata kal bo daih rawh u,’ tiin anni chu ka la hrilh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Chutichuan, hêng ka thu hi hriaa, zâwm apiang chu mi fing, lungpui chunga in satu nên tehkhin tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ruah a lo sûr a, tui te a lo lian a, thli te a lo tleh a, chu in chu a rawn nam sawk sawk a; mahse, lungpui chunga rem tlat a nih avângin a chim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hêng ka thu hi hriaa zâwm si lote erawh chu mi â ṭiauvut chung maia in satu nên tehkhin tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ruah a lo sûr a, tui te a lo lian a, thli te a lo tleh a, chu in chu a rawn nam sawk sawk a, a chim ta a, a sawp rup mai a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isuan chûng thu chu a sawi zawh chuan mipuiten a thu zirtîr chu mak an ti hle a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtute ang lova thu nei taka anmahni a zirtîr avâng chuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tlâng ata a lo chhuk hnuin mipui nasa takin Isua chu an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hnênah phâr a lo kal a, kûnin chibai a rawn bûk a, “Lalpa, i duh chuan mi tithianghlim thei e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan a han ban a, a dek a, “Duh e, lo thianghlim tawh ang che,” a ti a, a phâr chu a lo thianghlim ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Tu hnênah mah sawi suh; amaherawhchu, puithiam hnênah kal la, va inentîr rawh, i dam ngei tih miten an hriat nân; Mosian thil hlan tûr a ruat kha hlân rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Kapernaum khua a lo luhin a hnênah sipai za hotu a lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Lalpa, ka naupang a zeng a, inah a mu reng a, a na hle mai,” tiin tidam tûrin ṭhahnemngai takin a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chuan a hnênah, “Ka lo kal ang a, ka rawn tidam ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sipai za hotu erawh chuan a chhâng a, “Lalpa, ka in chhûnga ko lût tlâk che ka ni lo, thu chauh sawi la, ka nau chu a dam mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei pawh mi thuhnuaia awm ka ni a, ka hnuaiah sipaite an awm leh chhâwng a, ‘Kal rawh,’ ka tih chu a kal a, ‘lo kal rawh,’ ka tih chu a lo kal mai a; ka bawih pawhin ‘hei hi ti rawh’ ka tih chu a ti mai ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isuan chu chu a hriatin mak a ti hle a, a zuitute hnênah chuan, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, Israel zîngah pawh heti êma ring nasa hi tu mah ka hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, chhak leh thlang aṭangin mi tam tak an lo kal ang a, vânramah chuan Abrahama te, Isaka te, leh Jakoba te nên ruai an la kîl ho vang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram fate erawh chu pâwn thimah hnawh chhuah an ni ang; chutah chuan an ṭap ang a, ha an ṭhial ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isuan, sipai za hotu hnênah chuan, “Kal tawh le, i rin angin i chungah lo thleng rawh se,” a ti a. Tin, chumi dâr ngeiah chuan naupang chu a dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Petera ina Isua a luhin a pizawn khawsika mu chu a hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a kut a khawihsak a, a khawsik chu a reh ta a; a tho va, chaw ei a siamsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khua a lo tlai lam chuan a hnênah ramhuai man tam tak an rawn hruai a, thuin ramhuaite chu a hnawt chhuak a, damlo lo kal zawng zawng pawh chu a tidam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaian, “Ani chuan kan chak lohnate a la a, kan nâte a phur,” tia a sawi kha a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipui nasa tak a vêla awm Isuan a hmuhin Jordan râl lehlama kal tûrin a zirtîrte chu thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtu pakhat a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, i kalna apiangah ka zui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Sihalten kua an nei a, chunglêng savate pawhin riahhmun an nei; Mihring Fapa erawh hi chuan lu nghahna tûr a nei lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A zirtîrte zînga mi dangin a hnênah, “Lalpa, ka pa ka va vui zet ang e aw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan a hnênah, “Mi zui rawh, mitthiin anmahni mitthi chu lo vui mai rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, lawngah a chuang a, a zirtîrte chuan an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dîl chu nasa takin a lo fâwn ta a; tichuan, tuifâwnin lawng chu a rawn vûr hlup hlup mai a, ani erawh chu a muhîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An va kaitho va, “Lalpa, min chhanhim rawh, kan boral dâwn hi le,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Rin tlêmte u, engah nge in hlauh?” a ti a. Tichuan, a tho va, thli leh dîl chu a hau ta a, a lo reh ta ṭhuap mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mite chuan mak an ti hle a, “He mi hi mi eng nge a nih? Thli leh dîl lam pawhin a thu an awih hi le!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Râl lehlam, Gadarin mite ram chu a va thlenin ramhuai man pahnih, thlân aṭanga lo kalte chuan an rawn pan a; an kawlh êm êm mai a, chumi lam kawngah chuan tu mah an kal ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Pathian Fapa, kan chungthu-ah rawn inrawlh i tum elo? Hun tiam thlen hmaa min nghaisa tûrin i lo kal em ni?” tiin an lo au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuta ṭanga hla feah chuan vawk rual an tla sup sup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ramhuaite chuan, “Min hnawh chhuah chuan vawk kawchhûngah sâwn min luhtîr ang che,” tiin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Va lût ta che u,” a ti a. Tichuan, an lo chhuak a, vawk rual kawchhûngah chuan an lût ta a; tin, ngai teh, vawk rual chu an vaiin dîl kam khâm kovah chuan an tlân liam a, dîlah chuan an boral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A enkawltute chu an tlânchhia a, khuaah an kal a, thil awmzia zawng zawng, ramhuai mante chunga thil lo thleng te chu an va sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A khuain Isua hmu tûrin an lo chhuak ta a, amah an hmuh chuan an ram chhuahsan tûrin an ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua chu lawngah a chuang a, râl lehlam a kai a, a chênna khua chu a va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh, zeng pakhat, a mutna chawpin a hnênah an rawn zâwn a. Isuan an rinzia a hmuhin zeng hnênah chuan, “Ka fa, thlamuang takin awm rawh, i sualte ngaihdam a ni ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtu ṭhenkhat chuan, anmahni zîngah, “He mi hian Pathian pawi a sawi a ni,” an ti hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isua chuan an ngaihtuahte chu a lo hria a, “Engah nge in thinlunga sual in ngaihtuah ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘I sualte ngaihdam a ni tawh e,’ tih nge sawi awla, ‘Tho la, kein kal tawh rawh,’ tih hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Khawvêlah hian Mihring Fapa hian sual a ngaidam thei tih ka han hriattîr ang che u,” a ti a; zeng hnênah chuan, “Tho la, i mutna kha la la, i inah haw rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, a tho va, a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipuiin chu chu an hmuhin an hlau va, chutiang thuneihna mihringte petu Pathian chu an fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuta ṭanga a kal pah chuan chhiah khawnna hmuna ṭhu mi pakhat, a hming Mathaia chu Isuan a hmu a, a hnênah, “Mi zui rawh,” a ti a. Ani chu a tho va, a zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isua leh a zirtîrten ina chaw an kîl laiin chhiahkhawntute leh mi sual tam tak an lo kal a, an rawn kîlpui hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Farisai-ten chu chu an hmuhin a zirtîrte hnênah, “Engtizia nge in zirtîrtu hian chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte zînga a ei ve le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan a lo hria a, “Mi hrisêlten daktor an ngai lo va, mi bawrhsâwmten an ngai zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, ‘inthawina aiin khawngaihna ka duh e,’ tih hi eng tihna nge va zir rawh u. Mi dikte lam tûra lo kal ni lovin, mi sualte lam tûra lo kal ka ni zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Johana zirtîrte chu a hnênah an lo kal a, “Engati nge keini leh Farisai-te hian chaw kan nghei zut a, i zirtîrte lêmin an nghei ve loh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “An zîngah moneitu a awm chhûng chuan mo hruaitute chu an lungngai dâwn em ni? Moneitu chu an hnên ata hruai bo hun a lo la awm ang a, chumi hunah erawh chuan chaw an la nghei ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu man puan hlui, puan thar la sûk loh themin an bel ngai lo; a bel phuina tûr chuan a belna lai chu a kai thlêr zâwk ang a, a lo thlêr nasa lehzual ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Uain thar pawh savun ip hluiahte an thun ngai hek lo; thun ta sela, savun chu a puakkeh ang a, uain chu a bua ang a, savun ip chu a chhia ang; uain thar chu savun ip tharahte an thun zâwk ṭhîn a ni; tichuan, him takin a awm ve ve ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an hnêna a sawi laiin, ngai teh, hotu pakhat a lo kal a, kûnin chibai a bûk a, “Tûn maiah khân ka fanu a thi a; nimahsela, lo kal la, a chungah i kut nghat la, a lo nung leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu a tho va, a zirtîrte nên ani chu an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmeichhe pakhat thi pûta kum sâwm leh kum hnih dam lo a hnungah a lo kal a, a puan fêm a dek a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A puan chauh pawh dek ila ka dam mai ang,” a ti rilru a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isua chu a han lehhawi a, ani chu a hmu a, “Ka fanu, thlamuang takin awm rawh; i rinna hi i dam phah a ni e,” a ti a. Tichuan, hmeichhia chu chumi dâr a chinah chuan a lo dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isuan hotu in chu a va thleng a, phênglâwng tumte leh mipui ri mur mur a va hmuh chuan, “Kiang rawh u naupang hi a thi lo ve, a muhîl a ni zâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anni chuan an nuihsan ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mipuite chu hnawh chhuah an nih hnu chuan ani chu a lût a, naupang kut chu a chelh a, a lo tho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chumi ram zawng zawngah chuan chu thu chu a thang chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuta ṭanga Isua a kal zêl chu mitdel pahnihin an zui a, “Davida Fapa, min khawngaih rawh,” tiin an au zui zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ina a luh chuan mitdelte chu a hnênah an lo kal a, Isuan an hnênah, “Hei hi ka tih theih in ring em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Ring e, Lalpa,” an ti a. Ani chuan an mit chu a dek a, “In rin angin in chungah lo thleng rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, an mit chu a lo vâr ta a; Isuan an hnênah, “Tu mah hrilh hauh suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni chu an chhuak a, chumi ram zawng zawngah chuan a chanchin an tithang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An chhuah laiin ramhuai man ṭawngtheilo pakhat a hnênah an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ramhuai chu a hnawh chhuah veleh ṭawng thei lo chu a lo ṭawng thei ta a. Mipui chuan mak an ti hle a, “Israel-te zîngah hetiang hi hmuh a la ni ngai lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Farisai-te erawh chuan, “Ramhuai lal avângin a ni ramhuaite a hnawh chhuah ṭhin ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Isua chuan Pathian ram Chanchin Ṭha chu hrilin, natna leh chak lohna tinrêng neite tidamin khaw lian leh khaw tête a fang chhuak vek a, an sunagog-ah te a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mipuite chu a hmuhin, vêngtu nei lo berâmte anga mangang leh chavaia an awm avângin a khawngaih ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Buh seng tûr a tam tehlul nên, thawktu lah an tlêm si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />chutichuan, a buh seng tûra mi tîr tûrin buh neitupa dîl rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A zirtîr Sâwmpahnihte chu a ko va, thlarau bawlhhlawhte hnawt chhuak thei tûra thuneihna leh natna leh chak lohna tinrêng tidam thei tûrin thiltihtheihna a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tirhkoh Sâwmpahnihte hming chu hêng hi a ni: A hmasa berah Simona, Petera an tih leh a unau Andria te, Zebedaia fa Jakoba leh a unau Johana te, Filipa leh Bartholomaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thoma leh chhiahkhawntu Mathaia te, Alfaia fa Jakoba leh Thadaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kanan mi Simona leh a mantîrtu Juda Iskariota te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng Sâwmpahnihte chu Isuan a tîr chhuak a, thu a pe a, “Jentail-te chu tlawh suh ula, Samari mite khaw engah mah kal hek suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />berâm bo, Israel hnam hnênah chuan kal zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In zinnaah, “Vânram chu a lo hnai ta,” tiin hril zêl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Damlote tidamin mitthite kaitho ula, phârte tithianghlimin ramhuaite hnawt chhuak ang che u. A thlâwnin in hmu a, a thlâwnin pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In kâwnghrênah rangkachak emaw, tangka emaw, dâr tangka emaw pai suh ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />zin kawng atân iptê emaw, kawr pahnih emaw, pheikhawk emaw, tiang emaw keng hek suh u; hnathawktu chu ei tûr hmu tlâk a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Khaw lianah emaw, khaw tê-ah emaw, in luhna apiangah, thlenna âwm, mi zawng chhuak ula, in chhuah leh hma chu chutah chuan thleng reng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ina in luhin chibai bûk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu ina mite chu chibai bûk tlâk an nih chuan in thlamuanna thu chu an chungah thleng rawh se; an tlâk loh erawh chuan in thlamuanna thu chu in chungah lo kîr leh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi tu pawhin an lo lawm loh che ua, in thu pawh an ngaihthlâk loh chuan, chu in ata emaw, chu khua ata emaw in chhuah hunin in kea vaivut chu thing thla ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, rorêl ni-ah chuan chu khaw tuar tûr ai chuan Sodom leh Gomora ram tuar tûr chu a ziaawm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, chinghne zînga berâm lût angin ka tirh che u hi; chuvângin, rûl anga finga, ṭhuro anga pawi khawih lovin awm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mite lakah fîmkhur rawh u; Sanhedrin-ah an thlen ang che u a, an Sunagog-ahte an vua ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keimah avângin hotute leh lalte hmaah, anni leh Jentail-ten ka thu an hriat theih nân an la thlen ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, chutia an thlen hunah che u chuan in sawi tûr leh in sawi dân tûr engto suh ang che u; in sawi tûr chu a hun takah chuan hriattîr in ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sawitu chu nangni in ni dâwn si lo va, nangmahnia awm Pa thlarauvin a sawi zâwk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tin, unaupa in a unaupa tihhlum tûrin a mantîr ang a, pa pawhin a fa a mantîr ang; fate pawhin an nu leh pate an do vang a, an tihlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka hming avângin mi zawng zawngin an hua ang che u; a tâwp thlenga tuar peih apiang erawh chu chhandam an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“He khuaah hian an tihduhdah hunah che u chuan khaw dangah tlân ang che u; thu dik ka hrilh a che u, Mihring Fapa a lo kal hmain Israel khuate in fang chhuak hman lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Zirlai chu a zirtîrtu chungah a awm lo va, bawih pawh a pu chungah a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zirlai chu a zirtîrtu anga a awm leh, bawih chu a pu anga a awm chuan an tân a tâwk a ni. In neitupa mah Belzebula an tih chuan, a chhûngte chu an va ti lehzual dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Chutichuan, anni chu hlau suh u; lang leh lo tûra thuhrûk eng mah a awm lo, hriat loh tûra zêp pawh eng mah a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thima ka hrilh che u hi, êngah sawi ula, a rûka in hriat hi in chunga chuangin tlângaupui ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Taksa tihluma thlarau tihlum thei lote chu hlau suh u; hremhmuna thlarau leh taksa tiboral theitu erawh chu hlau rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chawngzawng pahnih pawisa pakhatah an hralh ṭhîn lo vem ni? Nimahsela, an zînga pakhat mah in Pa hriat lohvin leiah an tla lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />In samzaite lam pawh hi chhiar vek a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvângin, hlau suh u, chawngzawng tam tak aiin in hlu zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Chutichuan, mite hmaa mi ṭan apiang kei pawhin ka Pa vâna mi hmaah ka ṭan ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu pawh mite hmaa mi phat erawh chu, kei pawhin ka Pa vâna mi hmaah ka phat ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Leiah hian rem lêntîr tûra lo kal ka nih ring suh u, rem lêntîr tûra lo kal ka ni lo va, khandaih lêntîr tûra lo kal ka ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Fapa a pa dotîr tûr te, fanu a nu dotîr tûr te, mo a pasala nu dotîr tûr tea lo kal ka ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mahni hmêlma tûr chu mahni chhûngkaw zînga mi ngei an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mahni nu emaw, pa emaw, fapa emaw keimah aia hmangaih zâwktu chu ka mi ni tlâk a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mahni kraws pua mi zui lo chu tu mah ka mi ni tlâk an ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tu pawhin mahni nun humhim an tum chuan an chân ang a, keimah avânga an nun chân chuan an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Tu pawh lâwm che u chu kei mi lâwm an ni; tu pawh mi lâwm chu mi tîrtu lâwm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Zâwlnei chu zâwlnei a nih avânga lâwm apiang chuan zâwlnei lâwmman an hmu ang; mi fel chu mi fel a nih avânga lâwm apiang chuan mi fel lâwmman an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, hêng mi tê zînga pakhat pawh hi, zirtîr an nih avânga tui vâwt no khat pawh petu tu man an lâwmman tûr an chân tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isuan zirtîr Sâwmpahnihte chu thu a pêk zawhin chuta ṭang chuan Galili ram khuaahte zirtîr tûr leh thu hril tûrin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, tân ina awm Johana chuan, Krista thiltihte chu a lo hriatin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Lo kal tûra chu i ni nge mi dang kan lo nghâk ang?” tia zâwt tûrin a zirtîrte Isua hnênah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a chhâng a, “Kal leh ta ula, in thil hmuh leh in thil hriatte hi Johana va hrilh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitdelte an mit a vâr a, kebaite keiin an kal a, phârte tihthianghlimin an awm a, bengngawngten an lo hre thei ta a, mitthite kaihthawh an ni a, pachhiate hnênah pawh Chanchin Ṭha hrilh a ni ta bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu pawh ka laka beidawng lo chu an nihlawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu mite chu an kal tâk veleh, Isuan mipuite hnênah Johana thu a sawi ta a, “Eng ennawm en tûrin nge thlalêrah in kal? Thli chhêm nghîn luang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nih loh leh, eng vânga kal nge in nih? Puan nêm sina inchei en tûrin em ni? Ngai teh u, puan nêm sinte chu lal inahte asin an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eng vânga kal nge in nih? Zâwlnei en tûrin maw? A nih ngei kha, ka hrilh a che u, ani chu zâwlnei ai pawha ropui zâwk a ni: he mi hi alâwm,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Ngai teh, ka tirhkoh i hmaah ka tîr a, Ani chuan i hmaah i kawng a buatsaih ang,’ tia a chanchin an ziaka kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, hmeichhe hrin zîngah Baptistu Johana aia ropui zâwk an la chhuak ngai lo; amaherawhchu, vânrama mi tê ber pawh ani ai chuan an ropui zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Baptistu Johana lo awm aṭanga tûn thlengin vânram chu an bawh huai huai a, a bei vakte chu an lût ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Johana lo awm thlenga Dân thu leh zâwlnei zawng zawngten an sawi lâwk kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />in pawm duh a nih chuan ani hi Elija, lo kal tûra chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngaihthlâkna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Amaherawhchu, tûnlai mite hi eng nên nge ka tehkhin ang? Naupang, dâwrpui hmunahte ṭhu-a, an ṭhiante auva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Phênglâwng kan tumsak che u a, in lâm lo va, Kan ṭap vak a, in ṭap chuang bawk si lo,’ tite ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Johana chu a lo kal a, a eiin a in lo va, ‘Ramhuai a zâwl a nih hi,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi a lo kal a, a eiin a in a, ‘En teh u, mi vir, uain heh mi, chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte ṭhian saw,’ an ti leh si a. Pathian finzia chu a thiltihah a lang a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An sim loh avângin thil mak a tih tamna ber khuate chu a hau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nang, Korazin, i chung a pik e; nang, Bethsaida, i chung a pik e; in zînga thil mak tihte kha Tura leh Sidona tih ni se, saiip sina vut inphulin an sim tih an tilang daih tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u, rorêl ni-ah chuan in tuar tûr aiin Tura leh Sidon tuar tûr chu a ziaawm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang pawh, Kapernaum, vân thlenga chawi sân i ni dâwn em ni? Mitthi khaw thlenga nam thlâk asin i nih dâwn? Nangmaha thil mak tihte kha Sodom khuaa tih ni sela chu tûn thlengin a la awm reng tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u; rorêl ni-ah chuan in tuar tûr ai chuan Sodom khaw tuar tûr chu a ziaawm zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Isuan heti hian a ti a: “Aw, ka Pa, lei leh vân Lalpa, nangin mi fing leh mi thiamte lakah hêng thu hi i thup a, mi mâwlte hnêna i puan avângin ka fak a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ni, ka Pa, chutiang chu ṭha i tih zâwng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka pain engkim mi kawltîr tawh; Pa chauh lo chuan tu man Fapa hi an hre lo; Pa pawh chu Fapa leh an hnêna Fapain a puan duhnate chauh lo chuan tu man an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Nangni thawk rim leh phurrit phur zawng zawngte u, ka hnênah lo kal ula, keiman ka lo chawlhtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka nghâwngkawl bât ula, ka hnênah zir rawh u; thuhnuairawlh tak leh rilru inngaitlâwm tak ka ni si a; tichuan, in thlarau tân chawlhna in hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka nghâwngkawl chu a nuam a, ka phur pawh a zâng a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Isua chu sabat ni-in buhpui hmunahte a kal tlang a; zirtîrte chu an ril a ṭâm a, a vuite chu an thliak a, an ei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Farisai-ten an hmuhin a hnênah, “En teh, i zirtîrten sabat nia tih thiang lo chu an tih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan an hnênah, “A ṭhiante nên an rilṭâm laia Davida thiltih kha in chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian inah a lût a, amah leh a ṭhianten ei thian loh, puithiamte chauh ei thian, ‘chhang dah’ an ei thu kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nih leh sabat ni pawh ni se Tempula puithiam awmte chuan sabat an tihbawrhbân pawhin an thiang tho tih Dân bu-ah in chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, Tempul aia ropui zâwk hetah hian a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Inthawina aiin khawngaihna ka duh e,’ tih hi engtihna nge lo hre tawh ula chuan, mi pawisawi lote chu thiam loh in chantîr lo tûr,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi sabat Lalpa a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan a kal a, sunagog-ah a va lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai teh, kut zeng pakhat hi a lo awm a, Isua an hêk theih nân, “Sabat nia tihdam a thiang em?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “In zînga tu pawh hian, berâm pakhat nei ula, sabat niin khuarkhurumah tla ta sela, tu nge la chhuak lo vang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Berâm ai chuan mihring chu a va hlu zâwk êm! Chuvângin, sabat nia thil ṭha tih hi a thiang a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, chu mi hnênah chuan, “I kut phar rawh,” a ti a. A han phar a, a kut lehlam angin a dam ta viah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Farisai-te chu an chhuak a, amah an tihboral theih dân tûr ngaihtuahin an inrâwn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isuan chu chu a hriatin chuta ṭang chuan a kal hrang ta a. Mi tam takin amah an zui a, an za-in a lo tidam hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anni chu a chanchin puang lo tûrin a ti tlat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />zâwlnei Isaia hmanga a sawi kha a lo thlen theihna tûrin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“En teh, ka chhiahhlawh, ka thlan, ka duh tak, ka rilruin a lawm êm êma hi: A chungah ka thlarau ka dah ang; tichuan, Jentail-te hnênah rorêlna thu a puang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hnial lo vang a, a au hek lo vang a, kawtthlêrah pawh tu man a aw an hre bawk lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hneh tûra rorêlna a tirh chhuah hma zawng Luang sâwp a titliak fithla lo vang a, Khâwnvâr de sêt sêt pawh a timit lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama hmingah chuan Jentail-ten beiseina an nghat ang,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan ramhuai man mitdel ṭawngtheilo pakhat a hnênah an rawn hruai a; a lo tidam a; chutichuan, ṭawngtheilo chu a lo ṭawng thei a, a lo hmu thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mipui zawng zawng chuan mak an ti hle a, “He mi hi Davida Fapa chu a ni dâwn lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Farisai-te erawh chuan chu chu an hriatin, “He mi hian ramhuai lal Belzebula vâng lo chuan ramhuai a hnawt chhuak lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Isuan an ngaihtuahte chu a lo hria a, an hnênah, “Khawii ram pawh mahni indo chu an ṭiau ṭhîn; khawii khua pawh, chhûngkua pawh, mahni indo apiang an ding khawchhuak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Setana pawhin Setana vêk a hnawh chhuah chuan mahni indo a ni ang a, a ram chu engtin nge a din khawchhuah ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keiin Belzebula vângin ramhuaite hnawt chhuak ni ila, in mite khân tu vângin nge ramhuai an lo hnawh chhuah ṭhin ni? Tichuan, anni khân asin thiam loh chantîr zâwk dâwn che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian Thlarau vânga ramhuai hnawt chhuak ka nih si chuan in hnênah Pathian ram chu a lo thleng ta tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nih loh leh, miin mi chak chu a phuar hmasak zet loh chuan engtin nge a ina lûtin a sum a lâksak theih ang? A phuar hnuah erawh chuan a in chu a ramsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka lama ṭang lo tawh phawt chuan mi do va, mi lâk khâwmpui lo chuan a tidarh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Chuvâng chuan ka hrilh a che u, mite sualna zawng zawng leh Pathian pawi an sawi tinrêng te chu ngaihdam a ni ang. Thlarau pawi sawi erawh chu ngaihdam a ni ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tu pawh, Mihring Fapa sawisêl chu ngaihdam an ni ang a, Thlarau Thianghlim sawichhia erawh chu, tûn dam chhûngah pawh, hun lo la thleng tûrah pawh ngaihdam a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“ ‘Thing ṭha chu a rah pawh a ṭha,’ in tih loh vêk leh, ‘thing chhia chu a rah pawh a chhia,’ ti ta law law che u, thing chu a rahah a hriat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Rûl thlahte u, nangnin sual nei reng chungin engtin nge thu ṭha in sawi theih ang? Thinlunga liam khawpa khat hi a ni kâin a sawi chhuah ṭhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi ṭha chuan a ro bâwm ṭha ata thil ṭhate a phawrh chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, miten thu lawilo an sawi apiang, chu thu chu rorêl ni-ah chuan an sawi fiah a la ṭûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />I thu chuan thiam a chantîr ang che a, i thu vêk chuan thiam loh a chantîr bawk dâwn che asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Dân zirtîrtute leh Farisai-te zînga mi ṭhenkhatten an chhâng a, “Zirtîrtu, i hnên ata chhinchhiahna thil mak hmuh kan duh e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Tûnlai mi, sual tak leh uire hmang takte hian, chhinchhiahna thil mak an zawng a; nimahsela, zâwlnei Jona chhinchhiahna chauh lo chu chhinchhiahna thil mak rêng entîr an ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jona chu ni thum leh zan thum nghapui kawchhûngah a awm ang khân Mihring Fapa hi ni thum leh zan thum lei chhûngah a awm bawk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ninevi mite chu rorêlna ni-ah chuan tûnlai mite nên hian an ding za ang a, thiam loh an chantîr ang; Jona thu hril avângin an sim si a; ngai teh u, Jona aia ropui zâwk hetah hian a awm asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chhim lam lalnu kha rorêl ni-ah chuan tûnlai mite rual hian a tho ve ang a, thiam loh a chantîr ang; Solomona finna ngaithla tûr mahin kâwlkil ata a lo kal si a; ngai teh u, Solomona aia ropui zâwk hetah hian a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Thlarau bawlhhlawh chu mi kawchhûng ata a chhuahin chawlhna zawngin tui awm lohna hmunahte a vâk a vâk a, a hmu zo lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tichuan, ‘Ka in, ka chhuahsan takah khân ka kîr leh mai teh ang,’ a ti a; a va thlen chuan ruaka phiah faia tihfel diamin a va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tichuan, a kal a, amah aia sual hlîr thlarau dang pasarih a rawn hruai a; an lût a, chutah chuan awmhmun an khuar ta a. Chu mihring awmze hnuhnûng zâwk chu a hmasa aiin a lo chhe daih ta a ni. Chutiang bawkin, tûnlai mi, mi sual takte chungah hian a la awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mipuite hnêna thu a sawi lai chuan, a nu leh a unaute chu amah biak tumin pâwnah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi pakhatin a hnênah, “I nu leh i unauten biak tum chein pâwnah sâwn an nghâk a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan a hrilhtu chu a chhâng a, “Ka nu chu tu nge ni? Ka unaute pawh chu tute nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A zirtîrte lamah a kut a phar a, “En teh u, ka nu leh ka unaute hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tu pawh ka Pa vâna mi duhzâwng titute chu ka unaute, ka farnu te, ka nu te an ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Isua chu in ata a chhuak a, dîl kamah a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hnênah mipui nasa tak an lo pung khâwm a; tichuan, lawngah a chuang a, a ṭhu a; mipui zawng zawng chu ṭiauphovah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thu tam tak an hnênah tehkhin thuin a sawi a: “Ngai teh u, buh chi thehtu buh chi theh tûrin a feh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A han theh chuan a ṭhen kawngah a tla a, savaten an rawn tlân zo ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ṭhen pialtlêp chung lei pan hmunah a tla a, lei a chhah lo va, a lo ṭo thuai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nimahsela, ni a lo tlângsâng deuh va, a em vuai a, zung a kaih theih loh avângin a râwp ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ṭhen hnimhlîngnei zîngah a tla a, hnim chu a lo ṭhang a, a dîp ral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat chu lei ṭhaah a tla a, ṭhenkhat a lêt za te, ṭhenkhat a lêt sawmruk te, ṭhenkhat a lêt sawmthum tein a lo rah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngaihthlâkna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zirtîrte chu an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Engati nge an hnênah tehkhin thuin i sawi?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Vânram thu ril chu nangni hriat atân tih a ni a, an hriat atân tih a ni ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu pawh a nei chu an pêk belhchhah ang a, a ngah lehzual ang; a nei lo chu a neih chhun pawh an lâksak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutih avâng chuan an hnênah tehkhin thuin ka sawi a ni; hmu reng chunga an hmuh ṭhin lohva, ngaithla reng chunga an hriat ṭhin lohva, an hriatthiam hek loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isaia hrilhlâwkna thu kha an chungah a lo thleng a nih hi: ‘In ngaithla in ngaithla ang a, a ngaihna in hre si lo vang. In hmu in hmu ang a, in hmu fuh si lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />He mite thinlung hi a lo chawlawl ta a. An bengte an chhu chhêt a, an maimitchhîng bawk a, Chuti ni lo se, an mitin an hmu ang a. An bengin an hria ang a, An thinlungin an hre bawk ang a, an hawi kîr leh ang a, Anmahni ka lo tidam tûr,’ a tih ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nangni mit erawh chu a vânnei e, a hmuh ṭhin avângin; in beng pawh a vânnei e, a hriat ṭhin avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />thu dik ka hrilh a che u zâwlneite leh mi fel tam tak pawhin in thil hmuhte hi hmuh an lo châk ṭhîn a, an hmu si lo; in thil hriatte pawh hi hriat an lo châk ṭhîn a, an hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Chutichuan, buh chi theh tehkhin thu awmzia chu ngaithla rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tu pawhin Pathian ram thu chu an ngaihthlâka, an hriatthiam si loh chuan mi sual chu a lo kal a, an thinlunga theh sa chu a chhuhsak ṭhîn. Chûng mi te chu kawnga tlate chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, pialtlêp hmuna tla chu, thu chu ngaithlaa, lâwm taka pawm nghâltu hi a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />mahse, zung a nei lo va, rei lo tê chauh a daih a; thu avânga hrehawmna emaw, tihduhdahna emaw a lo awm veleh a tlu nghâl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hnimhlîngnei zînga tla chu thu chu a ngaithla a; nimahsela, khawvêl lungkhamna leh hausak nawmchenna chuan thu chu a dîp a, rah lovin a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lei ṭhaa tla chu, thu chu ngaithlaa hrethiam hi a ni; chumi chu a rah ta ngei a, ṭhenkhat a lêt za te, ṭhenkhat a lêt sawmruk te, ṭhenkhat a lêt sawmthumtein a pung ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tehkhin thu dang an hnênah a sawi leh a; “Vânram chu, mi, a lova chi ṭha thehtu nên chuan tehkhin theih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zânah mi an muthilh vek hlânin, a hmêlma a lo kal a, buh zîngah chuan buh lem a theh a, a kal bo leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Buh chu a lo ṭo va, a vuih hun chuan buh lem chu a lo lang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />In neitu bawihte chu an lo kal a, ‘Ka pu, i lovah chi ṭha i theh lo vem ni? Buh lem saw khawi ata lo awm nge ni le?’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘Hmêlmain a lo theh a nih chu,’ a ti a. Bawihte chuan a hnênah, ‘A nih leh, chûng chu va lâwr khâwm mai ila rem i ti em?’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan a chhâng a, ‘Ti lo ve, buh lem in lâwr khâwm zâwngin buh chu in pawt tel hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Buh seng thlengin ṭo za rawh se; buh seng hunah buh sengtute hnênah, ‘Buh lem chu lâwr khâwm hmasa zet ula, hâl tûrin têl rawh u; buh erawh chu ka buh inah seng lût rawh u,’ ka ti ang e,’” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tehkhin thu dang a sawi leh a; “Vânram chu anṭam chi fang khat miin a lâka, a lova a theh ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chi azawnga tê ber a ni a; mahse, a lo ṭhan sân chuan thlai dangte ai chuan a lo lian a, thing a lo ni a; chutichuan, chunglêng savate an lo kal a, a zârahte an riak ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tehkhin thu dang a sawi leh a: “Vânram chu hmeichhiain dawidim a lâka, chhangphut kho thum khat, zîngah a vaia a fan chhuah vek tûra a phul ang chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu Isuan tehkhin thu hmangin mipuite hnênah a sawi a, tehkhin thu lovin an hnênah eng mah a sawi lo; zâwlnei hmanga sawi kha a lo thlen theihna tûrin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Tehkhin thuin ka kâ ka âng ang a, Leilung pian tirh ata thil inthup chu ka sawi chhuak ang,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mipuite chu a kalsan a, inah chuan a lût a, a zirtîrte a hnênah an lo kal a, “Lova buh lem tehkhin thu kha min hrilh fiah teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Chi ṭha thehtu chu Mihring Fapa hi a ni a, lo chu khawvêl hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chi ṭha chu Ram fate an ni a, buh lem erawh chu mi sual fate an ni; hmêlma, buh lem thehtu chu Diabola a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Buh seng chu khawvêl tâwp hun tûr a ni a, a sengtute chu vântirhkohte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tichuan, buh lemte chu an la khâwm a, meia an hâl ang hian khawvêl tâwpah chuan a la awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hian vântirhkohte a tîr chhuak ang a, a ram ata mi titlu thei zawng zawng leh thil sual titu zawng zawng an thiar chhuak ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />rawhtuina meiah an paih ang; chutah chuan an ṭap ang a, ha an ṭhial ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan mi felte chu an Pa ramah chuan ni angin an êng tawh ang. Ngaihthlâkna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Vânram chu lova ro phûm rûk ang a ni; chu chu miin a hmu a, a chhilh leh a, lâwm êm êmin a kal a, a neih zawng zawng a va hralh a, lo chu a lei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Vânram chu sumdâwng mi, tuikeplung ṭha tak zawngtu ang chu a ni leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />ani chuan tuikeplung hlu tak pakhat a hmu a, a neih zawng zawng a va hralh a, a lei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Vânram chu lênkhang, tuipuia zâr, sangha chi tinrêng fûn khâwmna ang chu a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chu chu a khah veleh vaukamah an hnûk chhuak a, an ṭhu a, a ṭha zawng bâwmah an dah khâwm a, a chhia erawh chu an paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Khawvêl tâwpah chutiang bawkin a la awm ang. Vântirhkohte an lo chhuk ang a, mi fel zîng ata mi sualte chu an hlîr ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />rawhtuina meiah chuan an paih ang; chutah chuan an ṭap ang a, ha an ṭhial ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Chûng zawng zawng chu in hrethiam em?” a ti a. Anni chuan “Hrethiam e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Chuvângin, Dân zirtîrtu, vânram thu zir tawh apiang chu, in neitu, a robâwm ata thil hlui leh thil thar phawrh chhuaktu ang hi a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Isuan chûng tehkhin thu chu a sawi zawhin chuta ṭang chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />An khua chu a lo thleng a, an sunagog-ah chuan anmahni a zirtîr a; tichuan, mak an ti hle a, “He mi hian he finna leh hêng thil mak tihtheihna hi khawi ata nge a hmuh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />He mi hi mistiri fapa kha a ni lo vem ni? A nu pawh Mari an tih kha a ni lo vem ni? A unaute pawh Jakoba te, Josefa te, Simona te, Juda te kha an ni lo vem ni? A farnute pawh kan zîngah an awm vek lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hi khawi aṭanga a hriat nge?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Amah chu an hmu thiam ta lo va. Isuan an hnênah, “Zâwlnei chu ama khaw lamah leh a chhûngte zîngah lo chuan an chawimawi ṭhîn,” a tihsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />An rin loh avângin chutah chuan thil mak a ti tam lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi lai vêl chuan lal Heroda chuan Isua chanchin a lo hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a chhiahhlawhte hnênah, “Chu mi chu Baptistu Johana kha a nih chu; mitthi zîng ata a tho leh ta zuk nia; chuvângin, chûng thiltihtheihna chuan amahah a thawk a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heroda chuan a unaupa Filipa nupui Herodi avângin Johana chu a man a, a phuar a, tân inah a lo khung reng tawh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johanan a hnênah “Ani i neih hi a thiang lo ve,” a tihsak avâng khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chu tihhlum a duh a, zâwlneia an ruat avângin mipui a hlau si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Heroda pian champhaphâk ni-ah Herodi fanu chu a laiah a lâm a, Heroda chu a tilâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a dîl apiang pêk a tiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan, a nu fuih angin, “Thlêngah tûnah Baptistu Johana lu mi pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal chuan pawi a ti hle a; mahse, a thutiam avâng leh a chaw kîlpuite avâng chuan pêk tûr thu a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, mi a tîr a, tân ina awm Johana lu chu a tantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lu chu thlêngin an rawn la a, nula chu an pe a, ani chuan a nu hnênah a kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Johana zirtîrte chuan a ruang chu an va hlâwm a, an phûm a; Isua pawh an rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isuan a lo hriatin chuta ta chu lawngin hmun thlalêr lam panin a kal hrang ta a. Mipuiten an hriatin khua aṭangte chuan kea kalin an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lawng ata vaukama a chhuah chuan mipui nasa tak a hmu a, a khawngaih ta êm êm a, damlo an rawn hruaite chu a tihdamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tlai lam a lo nihin, zirtîrte chu a hnênah an lo kal a, “Hei hi hmun thlalêr a ni a, khua a tlai ta hle si a, khuaahte kalin an ei tûr an dap theih nân mipui hi kaltîr ta che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “An kal a ngai lo ve, nangmahnin ei tûr pe rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Hetah hian chhang panga leh sangha pahnih chauh lo chu eng mah dang kan nei lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka hnênah han la teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hlobet chunga ṭhu tûrin mipui chu thu a pe a, chhang panga leh sangha pahnih chu a la a, vân lam enin mal a sâwm a, a phel a, chhang chu zirtîrte a pe a, zirtîrte chuan mipuite chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An za chuan an ei a, an tlai ta a. An sem bâng chu an la khâwm a, bâwm sâwm leh pahnih khat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A eitute chu hmeichhia leh naupang tiam lovin patling hlîr pawh sângnga lai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mipui chu a ṭîntîr vêl chhûngin râl lehlama lo va kai hmasa tûrin zirtîrte chu lawngah a chuan luihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mipui a ṭîntîr hnu chuan ṭawngṭai tûrin tlângah a kal hrang a; tin, khua a lo thimin chutah chuan amah chauhvin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lawng erawh chu dîlah, vaukam aṭanga hla takah a awm tawh a, thliin a ni lo zâwngin a nem a, tuifâwnin a vawrh a vawrh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khawfîng chah dâwn laiin dîl chungah an lam panin a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zirtîrten dîl chunga a kal an han hmuh chuan, “Hmuithla a nih saw,” tiin an thlaphâng a, hlauvin an au ta chûl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mahse, Isuan anni chu a be thuai a, “Thlamuang takin awm rawh u, keimah ka ni e, hlau suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Petera chuan a chhâng a, “Lalpa, nang i nih chuan tui chunga i hnêna kal thu mi pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Lo kal ta che,” a ti a. Petera chu lawng ata a chhuak a, Isua lam panin tui chungah chuan kein a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, thli tleh chu a hmuhin a hlau va, a pil dâwn a, “Lalpa, mi chhanhim rawh,” tiin a au ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Isuan a ban ta nghâl a, amah chu a va chelh a, a hnênah, “Nang rin tlêm, engah nge i rinhlelh le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lawnga an luh chuan thli chu a bâng ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lawnga awmte chuan, “Pathian Fapa a lo nih takzet hi,” tiin, amah chu kûnin chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dîl an kân a, Genesaret ramah chuan an kai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chumi hmuna mite chuan ani chu an lo hria a, an kiang vêl ram zawng zawngah chuan mi an tîr a, damlo zawng zawng a hnênah an rawn hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />a puan fêm tal deh an ngên chiam a; tin, a dek apiang chu an dam ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Jerusalem aṭangin Farisai te leh Dan zirtîrtute chu Isua hnênah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Engati nge i zirtîrten upate thu rochhiah an bawhchhiat ṭhin? Chaw an eiin an kut an sil ngai lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Nangni pawhin engati nge in thu rochhiah avânga Pathian thupêk in bawhchhiat ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian chuan, ‘I nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh; mahni nu emaw, pa emaw sawichhia chu a thi ngei tûr a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangni erawh chuan ‘Tu pawh, a nu emaw, a pa emaw hnêna i mi chhawrna tûr zawng zawng chu Pathian hnêna pêk a ni tawh, titu chuan a nu leh a pa a chawimawi a ngai tawh lo’ in ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, in thu rochhiah avâng hian Pathian thu chu in bawh bo a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vervêkte u, Isaian hetia in chungchâng thu a lo sawi lâwk hi a tidik ngawt mai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘He mite hian an hmuiin mi chawimawi a, An thinlung erawh chuan mi hlat si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thurin ang hrimin mihring thupêkte an zirtîr a, An mi biakna hi a thlâwn mai a ni,’ tih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mipui chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Ngaithla ula, hre fiah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kâa lût chuan mihring a tibawlhhlawh lo va, kâa chhuak chuan, chu ngei chuan mihring a tibawlhhlawh zâwk ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan a zirtîrte an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Farisai-ten kha thu kha an hriatin an lungnih loh hle kha i hria em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan a chhâng a, “Kûng eng pawh, ka Pa vâna mi phun loh chu pawh chhuah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anni chu pawisa suh u, hruaitu mitdel an ni. Mitdelin mitdel vêk a hruai chuan khuarkhurumah an tla dûn ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Peteran a chhâng a, “Tehkhin thu kha min hrilh fiah ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Nangni pawh chuti êma mâwl in la ni cheu elo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kâa lût apiang chu pumah a tla thla a, dailênnaah paih chhuah a ni tih in hre lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kâa chhuakte erawh chu thinlung aṭanga lo chhuak a ni a, chûng ngei chuan mihring a tibawlhhlawh ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thinlung aṭang hian ngaihtuahna sual te, tualthahna te, uirena te, inngaihna te, rûkrûkna te, dâwta hêk te, Pathian pawisawina te a lo chhuak si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng chu mihring tibawlhhlawhtu chu a ni; kut sil lova chaw ei erawh hi chuan mi a tibawlhhlawh lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Isua a chhuak a, Tura leh Sidon khaw bialah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai teh, chûng lai rama mi, Kanan hmeichhe pakhat a lo kal a, “Lalpa, Davida Fapa, mi khawngaih rawh, ka fanu ramhuaiin a man tlat a ni,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan kam khat mahin a chhâng lo. A zirtîrte chuan, “Kan hnungah a au a au si a, kaltîr mai rawh,” tiin an rawn ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Berâm bo, Israel hnam hnênah lo chuan tirh ka ni lo ve,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, hmeichhia chu a lo kal a, “Lalpa, mi pui rawh,” tia kûnin chibai a rawn bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Fate chaw lâksaka uite hnêna pêk chu a âwm lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan, “A ni khawp mai, Lalpa; nimahsela, uite pawhin an pu dawhkân ata ei nawi tla chu an ei ṭhîn alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu veleh Isuan a chhâng a, “Hmeichhia, i ring nasa êm mai a, i duh ang takin i chungah thleng rawh se,” a ti a. Tichuan, a fanu chu chumi a chinah chuan a lo dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Isua a chhuak a, Galili dîl kam a hrût a; tlângah a chho va, chutah chuan a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kebai te, piangsual te, mitdel te, ṭawngtheilo te leh mi dang tam tak rawn hruaiin mipui nasa tak an lo kal a, a ke bulah an dah a; ani chuan a lo tidam ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mipui chuan ṭawngtheilote chu lo ṭawnga, piangsualte chu lo ṭhaa, kebaite chu kea kala, mitdelte mit lo vâr zo ta chu an hmuhin mak an ti hle a; tichuan, Israel-te Pathian chu an fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Isuan a zirtîrte chu a ko va, “Mipuiho hi ka khawngaih êm êm a ni, ka hnênah ni thum an awm tawh a, ei tûr lah an nei tawh si lo, rilṭâma hawtîr mai ka hreh a ni; chutilo chu, kawng lakah an ṭâmchhâwl dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Thlalêrah mipui heti zozai hraina khawp chhang khawi ata nge kan hmuh ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Chhang eng zât nge in neih?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Pasarih, sangha tlêm tê nên,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, mipui chu leia ṭhu tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chhang pasarih leh sanghate chu a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin a phel a, zirtîrte a pe a, zirtîrte chuan mipui chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An vaiin an ei a, an tlai ta hlawm a, an sem bâng chu bâwm sarihah an dah khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A eitute chu hmeichhia leh naupang tiam lovin patling ngawt pawh sângli an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mipui chu a ṭîntîr hnuin lawngah a chuang a, Magadan ramah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Farisai-te leh Sadukai-te a hnênah an lo kal a, amah fiah nân vân ata chhinchhiahna thil mak entîr tûrin an rawn ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan a chhâng a, “Tlai lam a lo nihin, ‘khua a ṭha dâwn a ni ang, kâwl a sen êm mai,’ in ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zîngah pawh, ‘Vawiin chu khua a chhe dâwn a ni ang, kâwl a sen a, khua a dur êm mai,’ in ti ṭhîn a; khaw awmzia in hrethiam si a, hun chhinchhiahnate erawh chu in hrethiam thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tûnlai mi, mi sual tak leh uire hmang takte hian chhinchhiahna thil mak an zawng ṭhîn a; nimahsela, Jona chhinchhiahna chauh lo chu chhinchhiahna thil mak rêng entîr an ni lo vang,” a ti a. Anni chu a kalsan a, a kal ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zirtîrten râl lehlam an thlen chuan chhang an lo ken theihnghilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Farisai-te leh Sadukai-te dawidim lakah chuan invêng ula, fîmkhur rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Chhang kan keng hauh lo mai le,” tiin anmahni zîngah chuan an sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isuan chu chu a hriatin, “Rin tlêmte u, engati nge chhang in neih loh thu ngawt in buaipui tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah pawh in la hrethiam lo cheu maw? Mi sângnga tâna chhang panga leh a bâng in dah zât kha in la hre reng lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi sângli tâna chhang pasarih leh a bâng in dah zât pawh kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chhang thu in hnênah ka sawi lo tih engtizia nge in hriat loh? Farisai-te leh Sadukai-te dawidim lakah erawh chuan fîmkhur rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu veleh, chhang dawidim lakah ni lovin, Farisai-te leh Sadukai-te zirtîrna laka fîmkhur tûrin anmahni a hrilh a ni tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isuan Filipa Kaisari bial a lo thlen chuan, “Miten Mihring Fapa hi tu nge a ni an tih?” tiin a zirtîrte chu a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Ṭhenkhatin, ‘Baptistu Johana,’ an ti a, ṭhenkhatin, ‘Elija,’ an ti a, ṭhenkhatin ‘Jeremia emaw, zâwlnei tu-a emaw,’ an ti,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “A nih nangnin tu nge nia mi hriat?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Simon Petera chuan a chhâng a, “Krista, Pathian nung Fapa chu i ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Simon Barjona, i nihlawh e, mihringin an hrilh lo che a, ka Pa vâna miin a hriattîr che a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, nang, Petera i ni tih ka hrilh bawk a che; he lungpui chungah hian ka kohhran ka rem chho vang a, mitthi khaw kulh kawngkhârte chuan a ngam lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vânram chabite ka pe ang che a, lei chungah eng pawh i phuar apiang vânah phuar a ni ang a, lei chungah eng pawh i phelh apiang vânah phelh a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan Krista a ni tih tu mah hrilh lo tûrin a zirtîrte chu a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi a chinah chuan Isuan Jerusalem-a a kal tûr thu te, upate, puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute lakah thil tam tak a tuar tûr thu te, tihhluma a awm tûr leh ni thum ni-a kaihthawha a awm tûr thu te zirtîrte chu a hriattîr ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Peteran ani chu a hruai hrang a, “Lalpa, ni lul lo ve; chûng chu i chungah thleng tawp suh se,” tiin a zilhhau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan Petera hnênah, “Setan, kal bo daih rawh, ka tân tlûkna i ni, Pathian duh dâna ngaihtuah lovin, mihring duh dânin i ngaihtuah a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Isuan a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Tu pawh mi zui duh chuan, mahni inngaihtuah chang lovin, mahni kraws puin mi zui rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu pawh mahni nun humhim tum chuan an chân ang a, tu pawh keimah avânga nun chân chuan an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Miin khawvêl hi a pumin nei sela, a nun chân si se, a tân sâwtna eng nge awm ang? A nih leh, miin a nun aiah eng nge a pêk ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi vântirhkohte nên, a Pa ropuina nên a lo kal dâwn si a; chumi hunah chuan mi tin an thiltih ang zêlin a rûl ṭheuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, heta dingho ṭhenkhat hi, Mihring Fapa a rama lo kal an hmuh hma chu thi lo tûr an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni ruk hnuah chuan Isuan Petera te, Jakoba te, Johana te a hruai hrang a, tlâng sâng takah a chhohpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An hmaah chuan a hmêl lan dân chu a lo danglam ta a; a hmêl ni angin a lo êng a, a silhfênte chu a êngin a lo vâr ta sur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai teh, Mosia leh Elija chu an hnênah an inlâr a, Isua nên an inbia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Petera chuan Isua hnênah, “Lalpa, heta kan awm hi a ṭha e; i duh chuan bawktê pathum ka khawh ang e; i tân pakhat, Mosia tân pakhat, Elija tân pakhat,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A la sawi lai mêkin chhûm vâr tak a lo zîng a, anni chu a khuh a. Chhûm aṭang chuan awin, “Hei hi ka Fapa, ka Duhtaka, ka lawm êm êma chu a ni; ama thu hi ngai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan chu chu an hriatin an bawkkhup a, an hlau êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a rawn dek a, “Tho ula, hlau suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An han dâk chhuak a, Isua chauh lo chu tu mah an hmu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tlâng aṭanga an chhuk laiin Isuan an hnênah, “Mihring Fapa hi mitthi zîng ata a thawh leh hma chu in thil hmuh kha tu mah hrilh suh u,” tiin thu a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Dân zirtîrtuten, ‘Elija a lo kal hmasa zet tûr a ni,’ engtiziaa ti si nge an nih le?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Elija chu lo kal tûr rêng a ni, engkim a siam ṭha ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u, Elija chu a lo kal tawh reng a; amah chu an hre lo va, a chungah an duh duhin an tih kha. Chutiang bawkin Mihring Fapa pawh hian an kut a tuar ve dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, zirtîrte chuan Baptistu Johana thu an hnênah a sawi a ni tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, mipui hnên an zu thlen chuan mi pakhat a hnênah a lo kal a, a hmaah a ṭhingṭhi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Lalpa, ka fapa saw khawngaih ang che; thla-em-ât a ni a, a tuar nasa êm mai; vawi tam tak meiah a tlu tawh a, vawi tam tak tuiah a tlu bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I zirtîrte hnênah ka rawn hruai a, an tidam thei si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Tûnlai mi, rinna tlachham leh tihmawhte u, eng chen nge in zîngah ka awm ang a, eng chen nge ka dawhtheih dâwn che u? Ka hnênah han hruai teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Isuan ramhuai chu a hau va, a chhûng ata a chhuak ta a; chumi dârkâr aṭang chuan naupang chu a dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zirtîrte chu a hnênah a fâlin an lo kal a, “Eng vângin nge keinin kan hnawh chhuah theih loh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “In rinna a tlêm vâng a ni. Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, anṭam chi fang khat ang rinna in neih chuan, he tlâng hnênah hian, ‘Heta ṭang hian sawtah sâwn insawn rawh,’ in ti ang a, a insawn mai ang. Tih theih loh rêng in nei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Galili ram an fan laiin Isuan an hnênah, “Mihring Fapa hi mihringte kutah mantîr a ni dâwn a, an tihlum ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ni thum ni-ah kaihthawhin a awm ang,” a ti a. Tichuan, an lungngai ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kapernaum an lo thlen chuan Tempul chhiah khawntute chu Petera hnênah an lo kal a, “In zirtîrtu hian Tempul chhiah a chawi ve ṭhîn lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Chawi ṭhîn e,” a ti a. Ina a va luh chuan Isuan a hnênah, “Simon, engtin nge i ngaih? Leia lalten bungraw chhiah emaw, lu chhiah emaw tu lakah nge an lâk ṭhin, an fate lakah nge mi hrang lakah?” tiin a lo sawi khalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Petera chuan, “Mi hrang lakah,” a tih veleh Isuan a hnênah, “Chu! An fate chuan chhiah an âwl alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela nang, dîlah va kal la, nghakuai chiah la, sangha âwk hmasa ber chu la rawh; a kâ keu la, chêng hnih i hmu ang; chu chu la la, kei leh nanga tân anni chu pe rawh; chutilo chuan, anni chu kan tilungni lo dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan zirtîrte chu Isua hnênah an lo kal a, “Vânramah tu nge ropui ber ang le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chuan naupang tê hi a ko va, an hmaah a dintîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, in inlamlêta naupang tê ang hi in nih loh chuan vânramah in lût tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, inngaitlâwma he naupang anga awm chu, vânrama ropui ber a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu pawh ka hming avânga hetiang naupang tê pakhat pawh lâwm chu keimah mi lâwm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tu pawh hêng mi ringtu zînga tê ber pakhat pawh titlu chu an nghâwngah chhangphut râwt lung lian pui awrhtîrin, tuifinriat thûk laia thlâk ni se an tân a hlâwk daih zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tlûknate avângin khawvêl hi a va pik êm! Tlûknate hi awm tûr rêng zawng a ni; nimahsela, tlûkna awmtîrtu chung chu a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I kutin emaw, i kein emaw a tihtlûk che chuan tan la, paih daih rawh; kut khing hnih emaw, ke pahnih emaw neia kumkhaw meia paih nih ai chuan, piangsualin emaw, ke baiin emaw nunnaa luh chu i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I mitin a tihtlûk che chuan kher chhuak la, paih daih rawh; mit khinghnih neia hremhmun meia paih nih ai chuan, mit khing khat chauh neia nunnaa luh i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Hêng mi tête zînga pakhat pawh hi hmusit lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh u, vâna an vântirhkohten ka Pa vâna mi hmêl an hmu reng ṭhîn tih ka hrilh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Engtin nge in ngaih? Miin berâm za nei se, an zînga pakhat chu vâk bo sela, sawmkua leh pakuate chu tlânga hnutchhiahin a bo zawng tûrin tu nge kal lo vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, a hmuh leh hlauh chuan sawmkua leh pakua vâk bo lote chungah ai chuan a chungah a lâwm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin hêng mi tête zînga pakhat boral pawh hi in Pa vâna mi duhzâwng a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“I unauvin i chungah thil sual ti sela, kal la, in pahnih chauhva hriatah zilh ang che, a ngaihthlâk che chuan i unau chu i hmin a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ngaihthlâk loh che erawh chuan mi dang pakhat emaw, pahnih emaw hruai ang che; chutichuan, in thu zawng zawng chu hretu pahnih emaw, pathum emaw kâa tihngheh a ni thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, anni chu a ngaihthlâk duh loh chuan kohhran hnênah thlen ang che; kohhran pawh chu a ngaihthlâk duh loh chuan ani chu i tân Jentail leh chhiahkhawntu ang ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, lei chungah eng pawh in phuar apiang vânah phuar a ni ang a, lei chunga eng pawh in phelh apiang vânah phelh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, lei chungah hian in zînga mi pahnihin inrema eng thu-ah pawh an ṭawngṭai chuan, ka Pa vâna miin a tihsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi pahnih emaw, pathum emaw ka hminga an ṭhut khâwm apiangin an zîngah ka awm si ṭhîn a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Petera a lo kal a, “Lalpa, ka unauvin vawi eng zât nge ka chungah thil tisual sela ka ngaihdam ang? Vawi sarih thleng em ni ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Vawi sarih thlengin ka ti lo va che, vawi sarih hmun sawmsarih thlengin ka ti zâwk che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chumi avâng chuan vânram chu, lalber tu emaw a bawihte hnêna sum chungchâng tihfel tum nên chuan tehkhin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A han tihfel chuan mi pakhat, talent sîngkhat ba a hnênah an rawn hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />rulhna a neih loh avângin a pu chuan amah leh a nupui nên, a fate leh a neih zawng zawng chu hralha rulh tûr thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, bawih chuan lei siin chibai a bûk a, ‘Ka chungah zahngai rih la, a za-in ka rûl vek ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, chu bawih chu a pu chuan a khawngaih ta êm êm a, a thlah a, a bat chu a ngaidam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimahsela, chu bawih chu a kal chhuak a, a bawihpui zînga pakhat a duli za ba a va hmu a, a man a, a hrawkah a rêk a, ‘I bat kha mi pe rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A bawihpui chuan, ‘Ka chungah zahngai rih la, ka la rûl ang che,’ tiin kûnin a ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, a duh lo va, a bat chu a tlâk hma zawng tân inah a khung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A bawihpuite chuan a thil tih dân chu an hmuhin pawi an ti êm êm a; a thiltih zawng zawng chu an pu an va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chu veleh a pu chuan ani chu a ko va, a hnênah, ‘Bawih sual, i ngen chiam avângin i bat zawng zawng kha ka ngaidam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ka khawngaih che ang khân i bawihpui chu i khawngaih ve tûr a ni lâwm ni?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A pu chu a thinur ta a, a bat zawng zawng a tlâk hma chuan nghaisatute a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi tinin thinlung taka in unaute in ngaihdam loh chuan, ka Pa vâna mi pawhin chutiang bawkin in chungah a ti ve ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isuan chûng thu chu a sawi zawhin Galili ram ata a chhuak a, Jordan râla Judai ramah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mipui nasa takin an zui a, chumi hmunah chuan a lo tidam hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Farisai-te a hnênah an lo kal a, amah fiah nân, “Eng vâng pawhin miin a nupui a mâk a thiang em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “A tîr ata Siamtu chuan hmeichhia leh mipaah a siam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘chumi avâng chuan mipain a nu leh pa a thlah ang a, a nupui a vuan ang; tichuan, an pahnih chuan tisa pumkhat an lo ni tawh ang,’ a tih hi in chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, pahnih an ni tawh lo va, tisa pumkhat an ni tawh zâwk a ni. Pathianin a zawm tawh avângin mihringin ṭhen suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “A nih leh, engati nge Mosian inmâkna lehkha pea mâk theih thu a pêk si?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Mosian in thinlung sak avângin in nupui mâk a phal a ni; nimahsela, a tîr ata chutiang a ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei chuan ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh uire vâng ni lova a nupui maa mi dang neitu chu a uire a ni. Mâk hnu nei pawh a uire a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Chutiang chu nupa chungchânga mipa dinhmun a nih si chuan inneih hi a ṭha lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Chu thu chu mi zawng zawngin an pawm thei lo, a pêkate chauh lo chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi tilreh, nu pum chhûng aṭanga chutianga piang rêng an awm a; mihring kuta reh an awm bawk a; vânram avânga tilreha insiam chawp an awm bawk a. Tu pawh a zâwm thei chuan zâwm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan an chunga kut nghata a ṭawngṭaisak tûrin a hnênah naupang tê tê an rawn hruai a; zirtîrte chuan an lo hnar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “Naupangte ka hnênah han kaltîr ula, hnar suh u; vânram chu hêng ang mite ta hi a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An chungah a kut a nghat a, chuta ta chu a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi pakhat a hnênah a lo kal a, “Zirtîrtu chatuan nun ka neih theih nân eng thil ṭha nge ka tih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Thil ṭha engah nge mi zawh? Ṭha chu pakhat chauh a awm, Nunnaa luh i duh chuan thupêkte chu zâwm rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan, “A engte hi maw?” a ti a. Isuan, “Tual i that tûr a ni lo; i uire tûr a ni lo; i ru tûr a ni lo; dâwtin i hêk tûr a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />i nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh, tihte leh, nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte i hmangaih tûr a ni, tihte hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tlangvâl chuan a hnênah, “Chûng zawng zawng chu ka zâwm ṭhîn, eng nge ka la bâk?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isuan, “Ṭhat famkim i duh chuan, kal la, i thil neihte hralh la, pachhiate pe rawh; chutichuan, vânah ro i nei dâwn nia; tin, lo kal la, mi zui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu thu chu a hriatin tlangvâl chuan beidawng takin a kalsan ta a, sum ngah tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isuan a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u; mi hausa tân vânram chu luh harsa tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hrilh leh a che u, Pathian rama mi hausa an luh aiin hriau benga sanghâwngsei luh tlang a awl zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zirtîrten an hriat chuan mak an ti êm êm a, “Chuti chu tu nge chhandam ni thei ang le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a en reng a, an hnênah, “Chu chu mihring tân tih rual a ni lo va, Pathian tân erawh chuan engkim tih theih a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Peteran a chhâng a, “Ngai teh, keini lahin engkim kalsanin kan zui ta che a, eng nge kan hmuh ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, Hun Tharah chuan, mihring Fapa a lalṭhutthlêng ropui taka a ṭhut hunah, nangni mi zuitute pawh hi Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnih chunga rorêlin lalṭhutthlêng sâwm leh pahnihah in la ṭhu ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu pawh ka hming avânga inte emaw, unaute emaw, farnute emaw, pa emaw, nu emaw, fate emaw, ramte emaw kalsan chuan a lêt za an hmu ang; chatuan nun an la chang bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Mi tam tak hmasa bera awmte chu hnuhnûng ber an la ni ang a, hnuhnûng bera awmte pawh hmasa ber an la ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Vânram chu in neitupa grep huana hnathawktu ruai tûra zîng taka thawk chhuak ang chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnathawktute nên ni khata duli hlawha an inrem veleh a grep huanah a tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dâr kaw vêlah a chhuak leh a, dâwrpuia mi dang ding mai mai a hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an hnênah, ‘Nangni pawh grep huanah va kal ve tawh u; a âwm tâwk apiang ka pe ang che u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An kal ta a. Chhûn laiah leh tlai dâr thum vêlah pawh a chhuak a, chutiang bawkin a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlai dâr nga vêlah a va chhuak leh a, mi dang dingte a hmu a, an hnênah, ‘Engati nge nilênga heta in din mai mai?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chuan, ‘Tu man min ruai hek lo,’ an ti a. Ani chuan, ‘Nangni pawh grep huanah va kal ve rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tlaiah chuan a huan enkawltu hnênah, ‘Hnathawktute kha ko la, a hnuhnûng bera ṭanin a hmasa ber thlengin an hlawh pe rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tlai dâr nga vêla rawihte chu an lo kal a, duli an dawng ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hmasa berte chu an lo kal a, dawn tam deuh an inring a; nimahsela, duli bawk an dawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hlawh an han dawn chuan in neitupa chungah an phunnawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Hêng hnuhnûng berte hian dârkâr khat chauh an thawk a, keini chhûn ni sa tuara thawk nilêngte tlukin i siam si,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ani erawh chuan a chhâng a, an zînga pakhat hnênah chuan, ‘ṭhiana, i chungah ka tidik lo hlei nêm; duli hlawhah kan inrem lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I ta kha la la, kal mai rawh; ka pêk che ang bawk kha hêng thawk hnuhnûng berte pawh hi ka pe duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ta na na na chu ka duh duha ka tih a thiang lo vem ni? A nih loh leh kei ka ṭhat avângin i vui a ni maw?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutiangin hnuhnûng berte chu hmasa ber an la ni ang a, hmasa berte pawh hnuhnûng ber an la ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem-a a chhoh dâwn laiin Isuan a zirtîr Sâwmpahnihte chu a hruai hrang a, kalkawngah chuan an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, Jerusalem-ah kan chhoh dâwn hi: Mihring Fapa hi puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute hnênah an mantîr dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anni chuan thi tûrin a chungah thu an titlu ang a, nuihza siam nâna hman tûr leh vuak tûr leh khenbeh tûrin Jentail-te hnênah an hlân ang; tin, ni thum nia kaihthawh a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Zebedaia nupui chu, a fate hruaiin Isua hnênah a lo kal a, ṭhingṭhiin chibai a bûk a, thil eng emaw a dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Eng nge i duh?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ka fapa pahnihte hi i ramah, i ding lamah pakhat, i vei lamah pakhat an ṭhut theih nân thu pe ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “In thil dîl hi in hre lo va ni. Ka no in tûr chu in in thei dâwn em ni?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Thei ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Ka no chu in in ngei ang; nimahsela, ka ding lam emaw, ka vei lam emawa ṭhuttîr chu ka thu a ni lo va, ka Pa buatsaihsakte tân a ni zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zirtîr sâwmte chuan chu chu an lo hriatin unau pahnihte chungah chuan an lungni lo ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan anniho chu a ko va, “Jentail-te chunga rorêltute chu an intilal êm êm ṭhîn a, an miliante pawhin an chungah thu an nei êm êm ṭhîn tih in hria;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />nangni zîngah zawng chutiang tûr a ni lo ve. Tu pawh in zînga mi lian nih duh chu in rawngbâwltuah a awm zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />In zînga ropui ber nih duh pawh chu in chhiahhlawhah a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mihring Fapa pawh hi rawngbâwlsaka awm tûrin a lo kal lo va, rawngbâwl tûr leh mi tam tak tlan nâna a nun pe zâwk tûra a lo kal ang hian,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Jeriko khua ata an chhuah laiin mipui nasa takin amah an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mitdel pahnih kawng sîra lo ṭhu chuan Isua a kal tih an hriat veleh, “Lalpa, Davida Fapa, min khawngaih rawh,” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mipuite chuan an hau va, ngawi tûrin an ti a, mahse anni chuan, “Lalpa, Davida Fapa, min khawngaih rawh,” tiin an au zual sauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Isua chu a ding a, anni chu a ko va, “Eng nge tihsak che u ila in duh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, mit vâr kan duh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isua chuan a khawngaih ta êm êm a, an mit a dek a; tichuan, an hmu thei ta nghâl a, amah chu an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem an lo hnaih ta a, Oliv tlânga Bethfage khua an han thlen chuan Isuan a zirtîr pahnih a tîr a, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“In hma zâwn khuaah sâwn va kal ta ula, sabengtung thlun, a kianga a no nên in hmu mai ang; phelh ula, ka hnênah han kai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tu pawhin in hnênah eng pawh sawi sela, ‘Lalpan a mamawh a ni,’ in ti ang a, a rawn kaltîr nghâl mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zâwlnei hmanga a sawi kha a lo thlen theihna tûrin chûng chu a lo awm a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Zion fanu chu hrilh rawh u, en teh, i lal chu i hnênah a lo kal e, Thuhnuairawlh taka sabengtung chunga chuangin, Sabengtung no chung ngeiah,” tih thu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, zirtîrte chu an va kal a, Isuan thu a pêk ang ngeiin an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sabengtung leh a no chu an rawn kai a, an chungah an puante an phah a, ani chu a chuang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipui zînga a tam zâwk chuan kalkawngah an puante an phah a, a ṭhenin hnahchhâwl an sât a, kalkawngah chuan an phah zêl bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hma lama kalte leh a hnung lama zuitu mipui chu, “Davida Fapa hnênah, Hosana, Lalpa hminga lo kal chu fakin awm rawh se; Chungnung berah khian Hosana,” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem a lo luh chuan, a khuain, “He mi hi tu nge ni?” tiin an phu ta mur mur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mipuiho chuan, “He mi hi zâwlnei Isua, Galili ram Nazaret khuaa mi a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isua chu tempulah a va lût a, chuta englo zuartute leh leitute chu a hnawt chhuak vek a; tangka thlengtute dawhkânte leh ṭhuro zuartute ṭhutthlêngte chu a nam thlûksak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />an hnênah, “‘Ka in chu ṭawngṭaina in an ti ang,’ tih ziak a ni; nangni erawh chuan suamhmangte pûkah in siam zâwk a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tempulah chuan mitdelte leh kebaite a hnênah an lo kal a, a lo tidam hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtuten thil mak a tihte leh Tempula, “Davida Fapa hnênah Hosana,” tia naupang aute chu an hmuhin an thinur ta hle a, “Hêngho thu sawi hi i hria em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Hria e, ‘Nausênte leh hnute hne laite kâa chhuak chuan fakna i tifamkim ta,’ tih hi in chhiar ngai lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anni chu a kalsan a, khawpui ata a chhuak a, Bethani-ah a kal a, chutah chuan a riak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, zîngah khawpui lam a pan leh laiin a ril a lo ṭâm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kawng kamah chuan theipui a hmu a, a va pan a, a hnah chauh lo chu eng mah a hmu lo va, “Rah lo kumkhua tawh ang che,” a ti a; theipui chu a vuai ta nghâl mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan chu chu an hmuhin mak an ti hle a, “Engtizia nge theipui hi a vuai nghâl tâk mai?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u; rinna in neiha in rinhlelh loh chuan, theipui chunga tih ang chang hi in ti lo vang a, he tlâng hnênah pawh hian, ‘Insawn la, tuifinriatah inpaih rawh,’ in tih chuan a inpaih mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Engkim, ring chunga ṭawngṭaia in dîl apiang in hmu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tempulah a lût a, a zirtîr lai chuan puithiam lalte leh vântlâng upate chu a hnênah an lo chho va, “Eng thuneihnain nge hêng thil hi i tih? Tu nge thu pe che?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Kei pawhin thu ka han zâwt ve ang che u, chu chu mi hrilh chuan tu thuin nge hêng thil hi ka tih ka hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Johana baptisma kha khawia ta nge, vâna mi thu nge mihring thu?” a ti a. An inrâwn khâwm a, “ ‘Vâna mi thu,’ kan tih chuan, ‘engah nge a thu in awih loh le?’ min ti dâwn si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘mihring thu,’ kan tih chuan kan tân mipui an hlauhawm si, mi zawng zawngin Johana chu zâwlneiah an ngai si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu an chhâng a, “Kan hre lo,” an ti a. Ani chuan an hnênah, “Kei pawhin tu thuin nge hêng thil hi ka tih ka hrilh bîk lo vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isuan, “A nih leh nangnin engtin nge in ngaih? Mi pakhatin fapa pahnih a nei a, pakhat hnênah chuan a va kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Ka fapa, vawiin chu grep huanah va thawk rawh,’ a ti a. Ani chuan, ‘Ka duh lo,’ tiin a lo chhâng a. Nimahsela, nakinah a rilru a lamlêt a, a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pakhat hnênah pawh chuan a va kal a, chutiang bawk chuan a ti a. Ani chuan ‘Aw le, ka pa,’ a ti a; nimahsela, a kal ta chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chu mite pahnih chu a tu zâwk chuan nge an pa duhzâwng ti le?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “A hmasa zâwk chuan,” an ti a. Isuan an hnênah, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, chhiahkhawntute leh nawhchizuarte chuan Pathian ram an luh khalh ta che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Johana chuan kawng dik a rawn kawhhmuh che u a, amah chu in ring si lo va; chhiahkhawntute leh nawhchizuarte erawh chuan amah chu an ring a, nangnin chu chu in hmuh hnu pawhin amah chu ring tûrin in lamlêt si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tehkhin thu dang ngaithla rawh u. In neitu pakhat a awm a, grep huan a siam a, palin a hung a, grep sâwr khur a lai a, vênbûk sâng tak a sa bawk a, thlawh hlawh tûrin huan enkawltute a pe a, ram dangah a kal ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A rah lawh a hun dâwn chuan a chanpual la tûrin huan enkawltute hnênah a bawihte a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huan enkawltute chuan a bawihte chu an lo man a, pakhat an vaw nek a, pakhat an tihlum a, pakhat lungin an dêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bawih dang, a hmasa aia tam zâwk a tîr leh a; anni pawh chu chutiang bawk chuan an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan, ‘Ka fapa hi zawng an zah ang chu maw,’ tiin a fapa chu an hnênah a tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nimahsela, huan enkawltute chuan a fapa chu an lo hmuhin, ‘He mi hi roluahtu tûr chu a nih hi; hawh u, that ila, a ro luah tûr hi i neihsak ang u,’ an ti hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu an man a, grep huan ata chu an theh chhuak a, an tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, grep huan neitu chu a lo kal hunin, chûng huan enkawltute chu engtin nge a rawn tih tâk ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Chûng mi sualte chu hrehawm takin a tiboral ang a, grep huan chu enkawltu dang, a lawh hun apianga a rahte chu amah pe zêltu tûrte hnênah thlawh hlawh tûrin a pe ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Lehkhathu-a, ‘In satute lung duh loh kha, chu ngei chu a kil lung ṭangkai ber a lo ni si, Chu chu Lalpa tih a ni a, Kan hmuhin mak kan ti,’ tih hi in chhiar ngai lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Chumi avâng chuan ka hrilh a che u, Pathian ram chu chhuhsak in ni ang a, a rah chhuah tûr hnam hnênah pêk a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh Farisai-te chuan a tehkhin thu chu an hriatin anmahni chungthu a sawi tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Man an tum a; mahse, mipui an hlau bawk si, zâwlneiah an ngaih tlat avângin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipui hnênah tehkhin thuin Isuan thu a sawi leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Vânram chu lal tu emaw, a fapa tâna mo lawmna ruai ṭheh nên chuan tehkhin theih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ruai ṭheh tûra a sâwmte chu ko khâwm tûrin a bawihte a tîr a; mahse, an lo kal duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan bawih dangte a tîr leh a, ‘Ka sâwmte hnênah khân, ngai teh u, ruai chu ka peih ta a, ka bâwngpate leh ran châwm thaute ka talh a, engkim peih a ni ta e; ruai ṭheh tûrin lo kal tawh rawh u, ti rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, an lo ngaihsak lo va, an kalsan ta mai a, a ṭhen an feh a, a ṭhen an sumdâwnnaah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi dangte chuan a bawihte chu an man a, zahthlâk takin an sawisa a, an tihlum ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal chu a thinrim ta a, a sipaite a tîr a, chûng tualthattute chu a tiboral a, an khua pawh a hâlsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tin, a bawihte hnênah chuan, ‘Ruai chu peih a ni ta, ka sâwmte erawh kha chu lo tel tlâk an ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, kawng pêng ṭhuamahte kal ula, mi in hmuh apiang ruai ṭheh tûrin va sâwm rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, bawihte chu an chhuak a, kawngahte chuan an kal a, an hmuh apiang, mi sual leh mi ṭhate pawh an hruai khâwm ta vek a; tichuan, mo lawmna in chu ruai kîltutein a lo khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Lal chu ruai kîltute en tûra a lo luh chuan inneihna thuam inbel lo mi pakhat a rawn hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a hnênah, ‘ṭhiana, engtizia nge inneihna thuam inbel lova heta i lo luh le?’ a ti a. Ani chu a ngawi ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal chuan a rawngbâwltute hnênah, ‘A kut leh ke phuar ula, pâwn thimah paih chhuak rawh u, chutah chuan an ṭap ang a, hâ an ṭhial ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sâwmte chu tam tak an ni a, thlante erawh chu tlêm tê an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Farisai-ten a thu sawia an man theih dân tûr an sawi ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An zirtîrte chu Heroda pâwla mite nên a hnênah an tîr a; anni chuan, “Zirtîrtu, mi dik tak i ni a, tihtakzetin Pathian thu i zirtîr ṭhîn a, pawisak chuan tu mah i nei si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, engtin nge i ngaih min hrilh teh khai, Kaisara hnêna chhiah chawi tûr kan ni nge ni lo?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Isuan an sualzia chu a lo hria a, “Mi vervêkte u, engah nge mi ṭawng awhtîr in tum? Chhiah tangka chu mi han entîr teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hnênah duli an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Hei, tu lem leh tu hming nge chuang hi?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Kaisara,” an ti a. Ani chuan an hnênah, “Chuti a nih chuan, Kaisara thil chu Kaisara pe ula, Pathian thil chu Pathian pe ta che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu chu an hriatin mak an ti hle a, amah chu an kalsan a, an kal ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi ni vêk chuan Sadukai-ho, thawhlehna a awm lo tite chu a hnênah an lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Zirtîrtu, Mosian, ‘Fa nei lovin mi thi sela, a unauvin a nupui chu rochungin a unau tân chi a thlahsak tûr a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aw le, kan zîngah unau mipa pasarih an awm a, a upa berin nupui a nei a, chi thlah lovin a thi a, a nupui chu a nau tân a hnutchhiah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />chutiang bawkin pahnihna pawh, pathumna pawh, pasarihna thlengin a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chu mite thih hnu chuan hmeichhia pawh chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, thawhlehnaah chûng mi pasarihte zînga tu nupui ber nge ni ang; an za-in an nei ṭheuh si a?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Lehkha Thu leh Pathian thiltihtheihna in hriat loh avângin in kal sual ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thawhlehnaah chuan nupui pasal an innei dâwn tawh lo va, vâna vântirhkohte ang mai an ni zâwk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mitthi thawhlehna thu-ah chuan Pathianin, ‘Kei hi Abrahama Pathian, Isaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian ka ni,’ tia in hnêna a sawi kha in chhiar ngai lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chu mitthi Pathian a ni lo va, mi nung Pathian a ni zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mipui chuan chu chu an hriatin a thu zirtîr chu mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sadukai-te chu a chhâng dang tih Farisai-te chuan an hriatin an inhmu khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An zînga Dânhremi pakhatin amah fiah nân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zirtîrtu, Dânah hian eng thupêk hi nge ropui ber?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Lalpa i Pathian chu i thinlung zawng zawngin, i nunna zawng zawngin, i rilru zawng zawngin i hmangaih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chu chu thupêk ropui leh pawimawh ber chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A dawttu, a anpui chu, ‘Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte hmangaih rawh,’ tih hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chûng thupêk pahnihah chuan Dân leh zâwlneite thu zawng zawng a inkhaikhâwm vek a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Farisai-te kal khâwm chu Isuan thu a zâwt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Krista chu eng angin nge in ngaih? Tu fapa nge ni?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Davida,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Davidan engtizia nge thlarauva sawiin ani chu, ‘Lalpa,’ a tih si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />‘Lalpa chuan ka Lalpa hnênah, Ka ding lamah lo ṭhu rawh, I hmêlmate i ke hnuaiah ka han dah ang e,’ a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Davidan ani chu, ‘Lalpa,’ a tih si chuan, engtin nge a fapa mai a nih theih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tu man kam khat mahin an chhâng thei lo va, chumi a chin chu tu man thu dang rêng rêng an zâwt ngam tawh hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, mipuite leh zirtîrte hnênah Isuan thu a sawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Dân zirtîrtute leh Farisai-te chu Mosia Dân zirtîrtua ruat an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, an hrilh apiang che u chu ti ula, zâwm zêl ang che u, an thiltih ang erawh chu ti ve suh ang che u; sawi zawng an sawi ṭhîn a, an ti si ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Phurrit hrehawm tak tak an siam a, mite an bel ṭhîn a, anni erawh chuan an kut zung hmâwr pawhin an khawih duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An thiltih zawng zawng chu mite hmuh atân a ni an tih ṭhin ni; an bân hrên leh chal hrêna bâwm chu an tihlai a, an puan fêm an tibuk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ruai ṭhehna hmuna ṭhutna ṭha ber te, Sunagog-a ṭhutna langsâr ber te, dâwrpui hmuna chibai bûk te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />miten ‘Rabi,’ an tihte an ngaina si ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nangni erawh chu, ‘Rabi,’ tihin awm suh u, in zirtîrtu chu pakhat a ni a, in za-in unau in ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, leiah hian tu mah, ‘ka pa’ ti suh u; in Pa chu pakhat a ni, vâna mi chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Hruaitute,’ tihin awm hek suh u, in Hruaitu chu pakhat a ni, Krista chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In zînga ropui ber chu in rawngbâwltu a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu pawh inngaihlu chu an tlâwm ang a, inngaitlâwm apiang chawimawi an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nangni Dân zirtîrtu leh Farisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! Vânram kawng chu mite in khârsak si ṭhîn; nangni lah in lût si lo va, a lût tûrte pawh an luh in phal hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangni Dân zirtîrtu leh Farisai-te u, in chung a pik e! Saphun pakhat siam tûrin tuifinriat leh khawmual in fang vêl ṭhîn a; in saphuna in siam hnuin nangmahni lêt hniha sualah in siam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nangni hruaitu mitdel, ‘Tempul chhâlin miin chhia chham sela, eng mah a ni lo; Tempul rangkachak chhâla chhia a chham erawh chuan a hlen tûr a ni,’ titute u, in chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangni mi â, mitdelte u, a eng nge ropui zâwk, rangkachak nge rangkachak tithianghlimtu Tempul chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Miin maichâm chhâlin chhia chham sela, eng mah a ni lo; a chunga thilpêk chhâla chhia an chham erawh chuan an hlen tûr a ni,’ in ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangni mitdelte u, a eng nge ropui zâwk, thilpêk nge thilpêk tithianghlimtu maichâm chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, maichâm chhâla chhechham chu maichâm leh a chunga awm zawng zawng chhâla chhechham a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tempul chhâla chhechham chu Tempul leh a luahtu chhâla chhechham a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vân chhâla chhechham chu Pathian ṭhutthlêng leh a chunga ṭhu chhâla chhechham a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Nangni Dân zirtîrtu leh Farisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! Pudina te, lêngmasêr te, pardi te sâwma pakhat in pe ṭhîn a; Dân thu pawimawh zâwk - dikna te, khawngaihna te, rinawmna te in ngaihthah si ṭhîn; nimahsela, chûng chu asin in tih tûr ni, a dangte chu ngaihthah chuang lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hruaitu mitdel, thosi in tel palh hlauva thli faia, sanghâwngsei thli fai lova lem tel si ṭhînte u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nangni Dân zirtîrtu leh Farisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! No leh thlêng pâwn lam in sil fai ṭhîn a, a chhûng lam erawh chu duhâmna leh insûm lohnain a khat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang, Farisai mitdel, no leh a chhûng lam chu sil fai hmasa rawh, a pâwn lam pawh a lo fai dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Nangni Dân zirtîrtu leh Farisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! Thlân hnawih vâr, a pâwn lama mawi taka lang, a chhûng lam erawh chu mitthi ruh leh bawlhhlawh tinrênga khat ang chu in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangni pawh chutiang bawkin pâwn lamah chuan mi hmuhin fel âwm takin in lang a, chhûng lamah erawh chuan vervêkna leh khawlohnain in khat si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Nangni Dân zirtîrtu leh Farisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! Zâwlnei thlân inte in sa a, mi fel thlânte pawh in cheimawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘Kan pi leh pute dam lai khân awm ve pawh ni ila, zâwlneite thisen chhuahnaah zawng kan tel ve lo vang,’ in ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutiangin zâwlneiho thattute thlah in nihzia in tilang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />In pi leh puten an lo tih ṭan tawh chu hlen law law rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Rûlte u, rûlrial thlahte u, hremhmun rorêlna chu engtin nge in pumpelh theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, chumi avâng chuan in hnênah zâwlnei te, mi fing te, Dân zirtîrtute ka rawn tîr dâwn; ṭhenkhat in tihlum ang a, in khêngbet ang; ṭhenkhat sunagog-ah in vua ang a, khaw tinah in tiduhdah zui zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abela, mi fel tak thisen chhuah aṭangin, Hmun Thianghlim leh maichâm inkâra Barakia fapa Zakaria thisen in chhuah thleng khân, lei chunga mi fel thisen chhuak zawng zawng mawh chu nangniho chungah a tla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, chûng zawng zawng chu tûnlai mite chungah a thleng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Aw Jerusalem, Jerusalem, zâwlneite thattu, i hnêna tirhte lo dêng hlumtu! Arpuiin a notê a thla hnuaia a awp khâwm angin i fate vawi eng zât nge awp khâwm ka tuma, in duh si loh kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ngai teh u, in Tempul chu a rauhsan a, a ram ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, ‘Lalpa hminga lo kal chu fakin awm rawh se,’ in tih hma chuan tûn a chinah mi hmu leh dâwn tawh lo a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua chu Tempul ata a chhuak a, a kalsan dâwn laiin, Tempul sak dân te chu entîr tûrin zirtîrte an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Hêng zawng zawng hi in hmu maw? Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, lung intiang rêng rêng hi pakhat mah tihchim lohva hnutchhiah a awm lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Oliv tlânga a ṭhut laiin zirtîrte chu anmahni chauhvin a hnênah an lo kal a, “Chûng chu engtikah nge a lo awm ang a, i lo kal lehna leh khawvêl tâwp chhinchhiahna thil mak eng eng nge awm ang, min hrilh teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Tu man an hruai bo loh nân che u fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hming chhâlin ‘Krista chu ka ni,’ tiin mi tam tak an lo chhuak dâwn si a, mi an hruai bo ṭeuh ṭeuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Indo ri te, indo chanchin te pawh in hria ang a, thlaphâng lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh u; chûng chu lo thleng tûr rêng a ni; hun tâwp erawh chu a la ni rih lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnam hrang leh hnam hrang an indo vang a, sawrkâr hrang leh sawrkâr hrang an indo bawk ang, hmun hrang hrangah ṭâm a tla ang a, lîr a nghîng bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu nau vei a inṭan ta tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Chumi hunah chuan hrehawm tuar tûrin an mantîr ang che u a, an tihlum ang che u; ka hming avângin hnam zawng zawngin an hua ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan mi tam tak an tlu ang a, an inmantîr tawn ang a, an inhaw tawn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zâwlnei der tam tak an lo chhuak ang a, mi an hruai bo ṭeuh ṭeuh vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suahsualna a pun dâwn avângin mi tam zâwk hmangaihna chu a la dai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, a tâwp thlenga chhel taka tuar peih apiang, chûng mite ngei chu chhandam an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ram Chanchin Ṭha hi hnam zawng zawng hriat tûrin khawvêl pum puia hril a ni ang a, chumi zawhah chuan tâwpna chu a lo thleng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Chutichuan, tiṭiautu tenawm zawlnei Daniela hmanga sawi kha, hmun thianghlima ding in hmuh hunah chuan (a chhiar chuan a awmzia hre rawh se)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judai rama awmte chu tlângramahte tlân rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />in chunga awm chu in chhûnga englo chuh tûrin chhuk suh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lova feh pawh a silhfên chuh tûrin haw hek suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nau pai te leh nauno pawmte chu an va khawngaihthlâk dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thlasik lai emaw, Sabat ni emawa in tlân a ṭûl loh nân ṭawngṭai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi hun chu a hrehawm êm êm dâwn a ni; chutianga hrehawm chu leilung pian tirh ata tûn thlengin a la awm ngai lo va, awm pawh a awm leh tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng nite chu tihtawi ni suh sela, mihring tu mah dam khawchhuak an awm lo vang; nimahsela, thlante avângin chûng nite chu tihtawi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chutih hunah chuan tu pawhin in hnênah, ‘En teh u, Krista chu heta hi,’ emaw, ‘Sawta saw,’ emaw an tih pawhin awih duh suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Krista der leh zâwlnei derte an lo chhuak dâwn si a; thei ang se thlante meuh pawh an hruai bo theih nân chhinchhiahna leh thil mak ropui tak tak an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngai teh u, ka hrilh diam tawh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, in hnênah, ‘Thlalêrah a awm e,’ an tih chuan kal chhuak suh u, ‘En teh u, pindan chhûngrilah a awm,’ an tih pawhin awih duh hek suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chhak lamah kâwl a lo phe a, thlang lam thlengin a ên ṭhîn. Mihring Fapa lo kal lehna pawh chutiang chu a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Khawiah pawh sa ruang awmna apiangah mulukawlhte an awm khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tin, chûng hun hrehawm chu a liam veleh ni a thim ang a, thla a êng hek lo vang; vân aṭangin arsite a tla ang a, vân thiltihtheihnate chu tihnghîn a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Mihring Fapa chhinchhiahna chu vânah a lo lang ang a, chumi hunah chuan leia chi tinrêngin ṭapin an âwm an chûm ang a, Mihring Fapa hi thiltihtheihna leh ropuina nasa tak nên vân chhûm zînga a lo kal an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Vântirhkohte chu tawtawrâwt ri ruai ruai nên a tîr chhuak ang a, anni chuan thlante chu kâwlkil li ata vân tâwp aṭanga a tâwp lehlam thlengin an lâwr khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tichuan, theipui kûng awm dân aṭang hian zir tûr in nei; a zîk a lo no va, hnah a rawn chhuah chuan nipui a thaw dâwn tih in hre ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin, nangni pawhin chûng zawng zawng in hmuh hun chuan ani chu a lo hnai tawh a, a lo thleng ṭêp tawh tih hria ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, chûng zawng zawng chu a thlen hma loh chuan tûnlai mite hi an ral hman lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lei leh vân a ral ang a, ka thu erawh chu a ral lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Nimahsela, chûng lo thlen hun tûr ni leh dâr chu, Pa chauh lo chuan tu man an hre lo; vâna vântirhkohte pawhin, Fapa pawhin an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Nova dam lai ang khân Mihring Fapa lo kal lehna chu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuilêt hma, Nova lawnga a luh ni thlengin an eiin an in a, nupui pasal an innei ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tui a lo lian a, an zaa a lâk bo vek hma loh chuan eng mah an hre lo, Mihring Fapa lo kal lehna chu chutiang bawk chu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan lovah mi pahnih an awm ang a, pakhat chu lâk a ni ang a, pakhat chu hnutchhiah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hmeichhe pahnihin buh an dêng ang a, pakhat chu lâk a ni ang a, pakhat chu hnutchhiah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Chutichuan, inring rengin awm rawh u, eng ni-ah nge in Lalpa a lo kal dâwn in hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nimahsela, hei hi in hria e, rûkru lo kal tûr in neituin hria sela, a lo inring ang a, a in a reh pawhtîr lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chuvângin, nangni pawh inpeih rengin awm rawh u, in beisei loh hunah Mihring Fapa chu a lo kal hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“An puin an chhûngkaw hotu-ah leh an chaw sem huna semsak ṭhîntu atân sum enkawltu rinawm tak leh fing a ruat tûra chu tu nge ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />An pu hâwn huna bawih chutiang ti a rawn hmuh chu a nihlawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, a neih zawng zawng chunga hotu-ah a rawn siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, bawih sual chuan, ‘Ka pu hi a lo haw lawk dâwn lo ve,’ ti rilruin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />a bawihpuite lo vêl ta sela, zu ruite nên eiin in sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />chu bawiha pu chu a rin loh ni-ah, a hriat loh dârah a lo kal ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />bung hnihah a rawn chhuah ang a, mi vervêkte chan ang a chantîr ang; chutah chuan an ṭap ang a, hâ an ṭhial ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Chumi hnuah chuan vânram chu nula sâwm, an khâwnvâr kenga moneitu hmuak tûra chhuakte nên chuan tehkhin theih a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An zînga panga an â a, panga an fing a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A â-te chuan an khâwnvârte an keng nâ a, a tui an keng tel lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A fingte erawh chuan an khâwnvârte kengin ûmin a tui an keng tel bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moneitu chu a lo kal har avângin an za-in an muthlu a, an lo muhîl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zân laiah chuan au thâwm a lo awm a, ‘Ngai teh u, moneitu chu a lo kal e, a hmuak tûrin lo chhuak rú khai,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu veleh nulaho chu an tho vek a, an khâwnvârte chu an buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A â-te chuan a fingte hnênah, ‘In khâwnvârtui kha min pe ve rawh u, kan khâwnvârte a thi dâwn e,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, a fingte chuan, ‘Keini leh nangni tân a daih lo dah ang e, a zuartute hnênah kal ula, va lei zâwk rawh u,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lei tûra an thang hlânin moneitu chu a lo thleng ta a; tichuan, a inpeihte chu ama rualin mo lawmna ruai ṭheh tûrin an lût a, kawng chu an khâr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan nula dangte pawh kha an lo thleng a, ‘Ka pu, ka pu, kawng min hawn rawh,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan a chhâng a, ‘Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, ka hre lo che u a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, inring reng rawh u, a ni leh a dâr chu in hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chutih hunah chuan vânram chu, mi, ram danga kal dâwna, ama bawihte kova, a sumte an hnêna kawltîr ang chu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawih pakhat chu talent nga a pe a, pakhat chu talent hnih, pakhat dang chu talent khat, an tlin tâwk tûr ang zêl ṭheuhvin a pe a; tichuan, a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Talent nga dawngtu chu a va sumdâwng ta nghâl a, talent nga dang a dek chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin talent hnih dawngtu pawh chuan talent hnih dang a dek chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Talent khat dawngtu erawh chuan lei a va lai a, a pu tangka chu a phûm ru ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Rei tak hnuah chuan chûng bawihho pu chu a lo hâwng a, an sum enkawl chungchâng a tihfelpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Talent nga dawngtu chu a lo kal a, talent nga dang a rawn keng a, ‘Ka pu, nangin talent nga mi kawltîr a, en teh, talent nga dang ka dek chhuak e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pu chuan a hnênah, ‘Bawih ṭha leh rinawm, i ti ṭha e, tlêm te chungah i rinawm a, tam tak chungah ka awmtîr ang che; i pu lâwmna chanpui ve rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Talent hnih dawngtu pawh chu a lo kal a, ‘Ka pu, nangin talent hnih mi kawltîr a, en teh, talent hnih dang ka dek chhuak e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pu chuan a hnênah, ‘Bawih ṭha leh rinawm, i ti ṭha e, tlêm te chungah i rinawm a, tam tak chungah ka awmtîr ang che; i pu lâwmna chanpui ve rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Talent khat dawngtu pawh chu a lo kal a, ‘Ka pu, mi ti kher kher i ni tih ka hria a che, i tuh loh pawh i seng ṭhîn a, a chi i theh loh pawh a rah i seng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hlau va, i talent kha leiah ka phûm ru a; en teh, i ta ngai kha i hmuh leh hi,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A pu chuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, ‘Nang bawih sual leh zawmthawpa, ka tuh loh pawh ka seng a, a chi ka theh loh pawh a rah ka seng ṭhîn tih i hria maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuti a nih a hnu, ka tangka kha tangkaa sumdâwngtute hnêna lo dah tûr alâwm, ka lo hâwnin a pung nên keiin ka hmu leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, a talent kha lâksak ula, talent sâwm neitu kha pe rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nei apiang an pêk belhchhah ang a, a ngah êm êm ang; a nei lo erawh chu a neih chhun pawh an lâksak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, bawih ṭhahnem lo kha pâwn thimah paih chhuak rawh u, chutah chuan an ṭap ang a, hâ an ṭhial ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tin, Mihring Fapa chu Vântirhkoh zawng zawng nên ropui taka a lo kal hunah chuan, a lalṭhutthlêng ropui takah a ṭhu ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />a hmaah chuan hnam tin an inkhâwm ang a, berâm vêngtuin kêl zînga berâmte a hlîr angin anniho chu a hlîr ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />berâmte chu a ding lamah a dah ang a, kêlte erawh chu a vei lamah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Chumi hunah chuan Lalber chuan a ding lama mite hnênah, ‘Ka pa vohbîkte u, lo kal ula, khawvêl siam tirh ata in tâna ram buatsaih chu chang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka ril a ṭâmin nangnin ei tûr mi pe a; ka tui a hâlin in tûr mi pe a; mikhual ka nihin mi thleng a; saruaka ka awmin puan mi sintîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />ka dam lohvin mi kan a; tân ina ka tânin mi tlawh a,’ a la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Tichuan, mi felte chuan, ‘Lalpa, engtikah nge rilṭâma kan hmuh che-a chaw kan pêk che? Tuihâlin i awma tui kan pêk che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Engtikah nge mikhuala kan hmuh chia kan thlen che? Saruaka i awma puan kan sintîr che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Engtikah nge dam lovin emaw, tân inah emaw kan hmuh che-a kan tlawh che?’ tiin an la chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Lalber chuan, ‘Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, hêng ka unau tê berte zînga pakhat chunga in tih chu, ka chunga ti in ni,’ tiin a la chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Chumi zawhah chuan, a vei lama mite hnênah pawh chuan, ‘ânchhe dawngte u, kumkhaw mei, Diabola leh a hote tâna buatsaihah chuan mi kalsan rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka ril a ṭâmin nangnin ei tûr mi pe lo va, ka tui a hâlin in tûr mi pe lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mikhual ka nihin mi thleng lo va; saruaka ka awmin puan mi sintîr lo va, ka dam loh lai leh tân ina ka tân laiin mi kan lo va,’ a la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Anni pawh chuan, ‘Lalpa, engtikah nge rilṭâmin emaw, tuihâlin emaw, mikhualin emaw, saruakin emaw, dam lovin emaw, tân inah emaw kan hmuh che-a rawng kan bâwlsak loh che?’ tiin an la chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, hêng mi tê berte zînga pakhat chunga in ti lo chu ka chunga ti lo in ni,’ tiin a la chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Chûng mite chu chatuan hremnaah an kal ang a, mi felte erawh chu chatuan nunnaah an kal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isuan chûng thu zawng zawng chu a sawi zawh chuan a zirtîrte hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ni hnih hnuah kalhlên kût a lo awm dâwn tih in hria a, Mihring Fapa hi khenbeh tûrin an mantîr dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Puithiam lalber Kaiafa an tiha in hual chhûng kawtlaiah puithiam lalte leh vântlâng upate chu an kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isua chu ngamthlêma mana, an tihhlum theih dân tûr ngaihtuahin an inrâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kût chhûng chuan ni suh se, chutilo zawng vântlâng zîngah buaina a chhuak hlauh dah ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethani-a phâr Simona ina Isua a awm laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />alabasta bûra hriak rimtui to tak keng hmeichhe pakhat a hnênah a lo kal a, a chaw kîl lai chu a lu-ah hriak chu a leih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan chu chu an hmuhin an thinrim a, “Engati nge hetia a tihriral mai mai ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He hriak hi man tam taka hralha, mi retheite pêk theih a ni si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan chu chu a hriatin an hnênah, “Hmeichhia hi engah nge in tihbuai ni? Ka chunga a thil tih hi thil ṭha ti a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In zîngah mi retheite chu eng lai pawhin an awm a, kei erawh chu in zînga awm reng tûr ka ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />He hriak rimtui ka taksaa a leih hi, phûm tûra mi buatsaih nâna ti a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, khawvêl pum puia he Chanchin Ṭha hi an hrilhna apiangah he nu thil tih pawh hi, amah hriat reng nân an sawi ve zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Sâwmpahnihte zînga pakhat, Juda Iskariota an tih chu, puithiam lalte hnênah a kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Amah chu ka mantîr ang che u a, eng nge min pêk ang?” a ti a. Tangka sawmthum an bûk chhuahsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan mantîr dân tûr remchâng a zawng ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhang dawidim telh loh Kût ni hmasa berah chuan zirtîrte chu Isua hnênah an lo kal a, “Khawii hmunah nge Kalhlên Kût chaw i ei tûr buatsaih ila i duh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Khawpuiah tu emaw hnênah va kal ula, a hnênah, ‘Zirtîrtu chuan, Ka hun a hnai ta a, ka zirtîrte nên Kalhlên Kût i inah kan hmang ang e, a ti,’ va ti ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan thu a pêk ang ngei chuan zirtîrte chuan an ti a; Kalhlên Kût chaw chu an buatsaih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tlaiah chuan zirtîr Sâwmpahnihte nên chaw an kîl ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An ei laiin ani chuan, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, in zînga mi pakhatin mi mantîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An mangang ta êm êm a, a hnênah, “Lalpa, kei chu ka ni lo vang chu maw?” an ti ta ṭheuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Thlêng mi zenpuitu ngei chuan mi mantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi a chanchin an ziak ang tak khân a kal dâwn a ni; nimahsela, Mihring Fapa mantîrtu tûr mihringa chung chu a pik e; chu mihring chu piang lo se a tân a ṭha zâwk tûr,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A mantîrtu tûr Juda chuan a chhâng a, “Rabi, kei chu ka ni lâwng chu maw?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “I ti alâwm le!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An ei laiin Isuan chhang a la a, malsâwmna a sawi a, a phel a, zirtîrte a pe a, “La ula, ei rawh u, hei hi ka taksa a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />No pawh chu a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin an hnênah a pe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“In za-in in rawh u, hei hi ka thisen thuthlunna, sual ngaihdam nân mi tam tak tâna chhuak tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u: Ka Pa rama nangni nên a thar ka in hun a thlen hma chu grep rah tui hi ka in leh tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hla an sak zawh chuan Oliv tlâng lam panin an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutah chuan Isuan an hnênah, “Zâninah in za-in kei hi min hawisan vek ang; ‘Berâmpu chu ka vua ang a, berâmte chu an darh ang,’ tih ziak a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nimahsela, kaihthawha ka awm hnuin Galili ramah ka lo kal hmasa ang,” a ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Petera erawh chuan. “An za-in nang an hawisan vek che pawhin kei chuan ka hawisan ve lo vang che,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che, âr a khuan hmain zâninah vawi thum mi phat ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Peteran a hnênah, “I hnênah thih ve a ṭûl pawhin ka phat tawp lo vang che,” a ti a. Chutiang bawkin zirtîr zawng zawng chuan an ti ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan Isua chu anniho nên hmun pakhat Gethsemani an tihah chuan an kal a, a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Saw laia ka va ṭawngṭai hlânin hetah hian lo ṭhu rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Petera leh Zebedaia fapate pahnih chu a hruai a, thlaphângin a lo mangang ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An hnênah, “Ka thlaphâng hle mai a, thihpui tham hial a ni. Hetah hian lo awm ula, lo inrâlring ve rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hma lamah tlêm a va kal hlek a, lei sia kûnin a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw ka Pa, a theih chuan he no hian mi pêl hrâm teh se; nimahsela, ka thu ni lovin nangma thu thu ni zâwk rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Zirtîrte hnênah chuan a lo kal a, an muthlu chu a rawn hmu a; tichuan, Petera hnênah, “E khai, dârkâr khat pawh in inrâlring thei lo a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Thlêmnaa in tlûk luh loh nân invêngin ṭawngṭai rawh u, thlarau zawngin a huam a, tisa erawh chu a chak lo va ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A va kal vawi hnihnaah chuan a ṭawngṭai leh a, “Aw ka Pa, ka in lohva hei hian mi pelh theih lul loh chuan, nangma thu thu ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A lo kîr leh a, an muthlu chu a rawn hmu leh a, an mut a chhuak hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A kalsan leh a, a vawi thumnaah a thu sawi ngai bawk sawiin a ṭawngṭai leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan a zirtîrte hnênah a lo kal a, an hnênah, “Muhîlin in la châwl ta reng a ni maw? Ngai teh u, a hun chu a lo thleng ta. Mihring Fapa hi mi sualte kutah hlan a nih dâwn tâk hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tho teh u, i kal ang u. En teh u, mi mantîrtu tûr chu a lo hnaih tâk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A la ṭawng lai mêk chuan Juda, Sâwmpahnihte zînga pakhat chu a lo thleng a, a rual chuan puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute leh vântlâng upate tirh mi tam tak, khandaih leh talhtum kengin an lo thleng ta rup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A mantîrtu khân chhinchhiahna tûr a lo hrilh diam tawh a, “Ka fawh chu amah chu a ni ang; man ang che u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu a va pan nghâl a. “Chibai, Rabi,” tiin a fâwp ta ngawih ngawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Ṭhiana, i tih tûr chu ti thuai rawh,” a ti a. Chu veleh Isua chu an rawn chelh a, an man ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Isua hote zînga pakhat chuan a kut a thawh a, khandaih a phawi a, Puithiam lalber bawih chu a sât a, a beng a hlawisak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chu veleh Isuan a hnênah, “I khandaih kha a paiah khung leh rawh; khandaih ruaitu zawng zawng chu khandaih vêkin an thi dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Vântirhkoh sîngsarih leh sânghnih aia tam zâwk min rawn tirhsak nghâl tûrin Pa ka ngên thei lovin mi ring em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Mahse, ngên ta ila, hetiang thil lo awm tûr sawina Lehkha Thu kha engtin nge a lo thlen theih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Isuan mipuite hnênah, “Suamhmang man tûr ang ziazângin khandaih leh talhtum kengin min man tûrin in lo thawk a ni maw? Tempulah ni tin ṭhuin mi ka zirtîr ṭhîn a, mi man si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nimahsela, zâwlnei Lehkha Thute chu a lo thlen theih nân hêng zawng zawng hi a lo awm ta a nih hi,” a ti a. Tichuan, a zirtîr zawng zawngin ani chu an hawisan a, an tlânchhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />A mantute chuan Isua chu Puithiam lalber Kaiafa ina Dân zirtîrtute leh vântlâng upate lo awm khâwmnaah chuan an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Petera chuan hnung feah Puithiam lalber in hual chhûng kawtlai thlengin a zui a; tin, a va lût a, a tâwpna hmuh tumin chhiahhlawhte zîngah a ṭhu ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute leh Sanhedrin mi zawng zawngte chuan Isua an tihhlum theih nân dâwta hêkna an zawng an zawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Hretu der tam tak lo kal mah se thu tling an hmu si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Nakinah erawh chuan mi pahnih an lo kal a, “He pa hian, ‘Tempul hi ṭhiata ni thuma sa leh thei ka ni,’ a ti e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tichuan, Puithiam lalber chu a ding chhuak a, a hnênah, “Hêngho hêkna che hi i chhâng thei na nge? An hêkna che hi eng tizia nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Isua erawh chu a ngawi reng a. Puithiam lalber chuan, “Pathian nung chhâlin thu ka pe a che: Krista, Pathian Fapa chu i ni nge ni lo min hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Chu, i sawi chu, ka hrilh a che u, nakinah, Mihring Fapa hi Thiltitheia ding lama ṭhuin vân chhûm zînga lo kal in la hmu dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Chu veleh Puithiam lalber chuan a silhfênte chu a pawtthlêr a, “Pathian pawi a sawi e, thuhretu dang a ṭûl em ni? Ngai teh u, Pathian pawi a sawi chu tûnah in hre ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />engtin nge in ngaih?” a ti a. “Thi tlâk a ni,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />A hmaiah chil an chhâk a, an hnek a, ṭhenkhatte chuan an bêng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />“Nang, Krista, tuin nge bêng che sawi rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Petera chu in hual chhûng kawtlaiah chuan a ṭhu a, nula pakhat a lo kal a, “Nang pawh hi Galili mi, Isua hnêna awm kha i nih hi,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “I thu sawi chu a awmzia ka hre hauh lo mai,” tiin an zaa hmaah a phat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />In hungna kawngkhâra a va chhuah chuan, nula dangin ani chu a lo hmu a, chuta awmte hnênah chuan, “He mi hi Nazaret Isua hnêna awm ve kha a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />“Chu mihring chu ka hre lo,” tiin chhechhamin a phat leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Rei lo te chinah chuta dingte chuan Petera chu, “Nang pawh hi an zînga mi i ni ngei ang, i awphawiah a hriat alâwm,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan ânchhe dawn huamin chhia a chham a, “Chu mihring chu ka hre lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Ar a khuang ta nghâl a, “âr khuan hmain nangin vawi thum mi phat ang,” Isuan a tih kha Petera chuan a hre chhuak a. Tichuan, a chhuak a, a ṭap ta zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zîng a lo nih chuan puithiam lalte leh vântlâng upa zawng zawng chuan Isua tihhlum dân tûr an rêl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An phuar a, an kai a, Ramawptu Pilata hnênah an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mantîrtu Juda chuan Isua chu thiam loh an chantîr tih a hriat veleh a inchhîr a, tangka sawmthum kha puithiam lalte leh upate a pe kîr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mi pawisawi lo thi tûra ka mantîr kha ka lo tisual a ni,” a ti a. Anni erawh chuan, “Chu chu kan tân eng nge pawi ang? Nangin i tih tihin ti rawh,” an lo tihsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, tangka chu Hmun Thianghlimah a paih lût a, a kal a, a va inâwk hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puithiam lalte chuan tangka chu an la a, “Hei hi Tempul tangka bâwma dah a thiang lo ve, thisen man a ni si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, an inrâwn a, mikhual phûm nân bêlvawtu hmun an lei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin a ni, chu hmun chu, tûn thlengin ‘Thisen hmun’ an tih tâk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, zâwlnei Jeremia hmanga sawi kha a lo thleng ta a ni: “Israel fa tuten emaw Tangka sawmthum an chhiara Man chu an la a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpan thu a pêk ang khân Bêlvawtu hmun manah an pe a,” a tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isua chu Ramawptu hmaah chuan a ding a, Ramawptu chuan, “Juda-te lal i ni maw?” tiin a zâwt a. Isuan a hnênah, “I sawi chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh upate hêkna chu a enga mah a chhâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilatan a hnênah, “An hêkna zozai che hi i hre lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, a chhâng hlek lo va, an hêkna pakhat mah a chhân loh avâng chuan mak a ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ramawptu chuan kût niin mi tâng pakhat an dîl apiang a chhuahsak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan mi hmingthang tak Baraba an tih chu lung inah a tâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, an lo pung khâwm chu Pilatan, “Tu nge chhuahsak che u ila in duh, Baraba nge Isua, Krista an tiha hi?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Îtsîkna avângin ani chu a hnênah an rawn hlân tih a hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rorêlnaa a ṭhut laiin Pilata nupuiin, “Kha mi fel tak chungah khân eng mah ti suh; vawiin hian amah avângin mumangah thil tam tak ka tuar a ni,” tiin a rawn chah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh upate chuan Baraba chu chhuaha, Isua chu tiboral tûra ngên tûrin mipuite chu an thlêm thlu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ramawptu chuan an hnênah, “Anni pahnih hi a tu zâwk hi nge chhuahsak che u ila in duh?” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Baraba,” an ti a. Pilatan an hnênah, “Isua, Krista an tih hi, engtin nge ka tih tâk ang le?” a ti a. An za-in, “Krawsah khêngbet rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ramawptu chuan, “Engah maw, eng nge a tihsual ni?” a ti a. Nimahsela, mipui chu, “Krawsah khêngbet rawh,” tiin an au ta tuar tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilatan engtia tih mah a sâwt lo va, buaina a chhuak mai dâwna a hriatin, tui a la a, mipui hmaah chuan a kut a sil a, “He mi fel thisenah hian ka hul e, nangnin in tih tihin ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mipui chuan an za-in, “A thisen mawh chu keimahni chungah leh kan fate chungah awm rawh se,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, Baraba chu a chhuahsak a; Isua erawh chu sipaite a vuaktîr a, krawsa khenbeh tûrin an kutah a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, Ramawptu sipaite chuan Isua chu praitorian-ah an hruai lût a, an pâwla mi zawng zawng a bulah an au khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kawr an hlihsak a, kawrfual senduk an hâktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chawimawina atân hlîng an kual a, an khumtîr a, a kut ding lamin tiang an kentîr a, a hmaah an ṭhingṭhi a, “Chibai, Juda-te lal,” tiin nuihza siam nân an hmang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ani chu chil an chhâk a, tiang chu an lâksak a, a luah an vua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nuihza siam nân an hman zawhin kawrfual chu an hlihsak a, ama kawr chu an hâktîr leh a, krawsa khenbeh tûrin an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kalkawnga an kal laiin Kurini khuaa mi, a hming Simona an hmu a, Isua kraws putsak tûrin an man a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Golgotha, ‘Luruh hmun’ an tih chu an va thleng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chutah chuan uain, thil kha nêna pawlh a in tûrin an pe a; a han tem a, a in duh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An khenbeh zawhin a silhfênte chu ṭhumvâwrin an insem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutah chuan an ṭhu a, amah chu an vêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amah hêkna, ‘He mi hi Isua, Juda-te lal a ni,’ tih ziak a lu chungah chuan an bel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A rual chuan suamhmang pahnih krawsah an khêngbet ve a, a ding lamah pakhat, a vei lamah pakhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mi veivâk nuk nukte chuan an lu an thing a, an tiel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Nang, Tempul hi ṭhiata ni thuma din leh theitu, intidam rawh. Pathian Fapa i nih meuh chuan kraws ata kha lo chhuk ta che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin puithiam lalte chuan Dân zirtîrtute leh upate nên nuihzatin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Mi dang mah tidam ṭhîn, mahni lah intidam thei si lo! Israel lal alâwm, tûnah hian kraws ata lo chhuk sela kan ring ang chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pathian a ring alâwm, amah hi a duh chuan tûnah chhan chhuak ang hmiang, ‘Pathian Fapa ka ni,’ a ti si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Suamhmang khenbehte pawh chuan chutiang bawkin an tiel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Dâr sâwm leh pahnih aṭanga tlai dâr thum thlengin khawvêl pum pui a thim ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tlai dâr thum vêlah chuan Isua chu ring takin a au chhuak a, “Eli, Eli, lema sabakthani” a ti a; chu chu, ‘Ka Pathian, ka Pathian, engah nge mi kalsan?” tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A kianga ding ṭhenkhat chuan chu chu an hriatin, “He mi hian Elija a ko va ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />An zînga pakhat chu a tlân nghâl a, sponj a la a, uain thûrah a chiah a, tiangah a târ a, Isua chu intîr a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mi dangte chuan, “Ngawi rú, amah chhan tûrin Elija a lo kal emaw i en ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Isua chu ring takin a au leh a, a thlarau a thlah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ngai teh, Tempul chhûng puanzâr chu a chung lam aṭangin a hnuai lam thlengin a thlêr thla a; lîr a lo nghîng a, lungpuite a khi chat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Thlânte a lo inhawng a, mi thianghlim muhîl tawhte taksa tam tak pawh kaihthawh a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />A thawhleh hnuah chuan chûngte chu thlân ata lo chhuakin khaw thianghlimah chuan an lût a, mi tam tak hnênah an inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Sipai za hotu leh a bula Isua vênga awm vete chuan, lîrnghîng leh thil lo thlengte chu an hmuhin an hlau ta êm êm a, “He mi hi Pathian Fapa a ni ngei mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Chutah chuan hmeichhe tam tak, a rawngbâwla Galili aṭanga Isua rawn zuitute chu an awm bawk a, hla tak aṭangin an thlîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Chûng zîngah chuan Magdala mi Mari te, Jakoba leh Josia nu Mari te an tel a, Zebedaia nupui pawh a tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tlaiah chuan Arimathai khuaa mi hausa pakhat, a hming Josefa a lo kal a, ani pawh chu Isua zirtîr a ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Chu mi chu Pilata hnênah a va kal a, Isua ruang chu a dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Pilata chuan a lo phal a. Tichuan, Isua ruang chu Josefa chuan a hlâwm a, puan zai sîn fai takin a tuam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />ama thlân thar, lung a ker kuakah chuan a zalh a; thlân kawngka chu lung lian takin a khâr a, a kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Chutah chuan Magdala mi Mari leh Mari dang chu an awm ve a, thlân hma zâwnah chuan an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />A tûk, Sabat ni chuan puithiam lalte leh Farisai-te chu a huhovin Pilata hnênah an kal a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />“Ka pu, Tihdertua khân a dam laiin, ‘ni thum chinah ka tho leh ang,’ a tih kan hre reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Chuvângin, thlân chu ni thum ni thlenga vêng ṭha tûrin thu pe rawh; chuti lo chu a zirtîrten amah chu an va ru hlauh ang a, vântlâng hnênah, ‘Mitthi zîng ata a tholeh ta a ni,’ an ti dah ang e; tichuan, tihderna hnuhnûng zâwk chu a hmasa ai khân a ṭha lo lehzual ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Pilatan an hnênah, “Vêngtute in nei alâwm, kal ula, ṭha in tih ang apiangin vêntîr rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Chutichuan, an kal a, thlân khârna lung chu an chhinchhiah a, vêngtute chu an vêntîr ta tlat a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabat ni a lo ral a, Pathianni zînga khua a vâr dâwnin Magdala mi Mari leh Mari dang chu thlân en tûrin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh, lîr nasa takin a lo nghîng a; Lalpa Vântirhkoh vân aṭangin a lo chhuk a, lung chu a rawn lum sawn a, a chungah a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lan dân chu kâwlphe ang a ni a, a silhfênte chu vûr angin a vâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah an hlauh êm avângin vêngtute chu an khûr a, mitthi ang maiin an lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chuan hmeichhiate chu a bia a, “Nangni chuan hlau suh u, Isua an khenbeh kha in zawng tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hetah a awm tawh lo ve, a sawi ang ngeiin kaihthawh a ni tawh a, a mutna hmun hi rawn en teh mah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, kal thuai ula, a zirtîrte hnênah, ‘Mitthi zîng ata kaihthawh a ni ta, Galili ramah a lo kal hmasa dâwn a, chutah chuan amah in hmu ang,’ ti ang che u. Ngai teh u, ka hrilh tawh che u hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hlau leh lâwm êm êm chungin thlân aṭang chuan hmanhmawh takin an kal a, zirtîrte hrilh tûr chuan an tlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh, Isuan anni chu a tâwk a, “Chibai u,” a ti a. Tichuan, a kephahte chu an vuan a, kûnin chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Hlau suh u, kal ta ula, Galili rama kal tûrin ka unaute va hrilh rawh u; chutah chuan mi hmu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An kal lai chuan vêngtu ṭhenkhat chu khawpuiah an va lût a, thil lo thleng zawng zawng chu puithiam lalte an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Upate nên an kal khâwm a, an inrâwn zawhin vêngtute chu tangka tam tak an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Zânah kan muthilh hlânin a zirtîrte an lo kal a, amah an ru ta a ni,” ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ramawptuin chu chu a lo hre ta a nih leh amah chu kan thlêm ang a, hlauhthâwn tûr nei lovin kan siam ang che u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, tangka chu an la a, an hrilh ang zêl chuan an ti ta a; tichuan, tûn thlengin chu thu chu Juda-te zîngah an la sawi darh ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zirtîr Sâwmpakhatte chu Galili ramah, Isuan tlâng a ruatsakah chuan an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amah an hmuh chuan kûnin chibai an bûk a; ṭhenkhat erawh chuan an ringhlel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Isuan a rawn pan a, anni chu a bia a, “Lei leh vâna thuneihna zawng zawng pêk ka ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, kal ula, hnam zawng zawng zirtîrah siam rawh u; Pa leh Fapa leh Thlarau Thianghlim hmingah chuan baptis ula, thu ka pêk zawng zawng che u pawm tûrin zirtîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh u, kei, kumkhuain, khawvêl tâwp thleng pawhin, in hnênah ka awm zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
</usx>
